{"type": "channel", "channel": {"team": "ecommerce", "name": "personalization", "display_name": "Personalization & Recommendations", "type": "O", "header": "Product recommendation engine discussions", "purpose": "Channel for discussing personalized shopping experiences and recommendation systems"}}
{"type": "user", "user": {"username": "jennifer.chen", "email": "jennifer.chen@leesmarket.com", "password": "LM2025!secure", "first_name": "Jennifer", "last_name": "Chen", "position": "E-Commerce Director", "teams": [{"name": "ecommerce", "roles": "team_admin"}]}}
{"type": "user", "user": {"username": "marcus.wong", "email": "marcus.wong@leesmarket.com", "password": "LM2025!secure", "first_name": "Marcus", "last_name": "Wong", "position": "Data Analyst", "teams": [{"name": "ecommerce", "roles": "team_user"}]}}
{"type": "user", "user": {"username": "priya.sharma", "email": "priya.sharma@leesmarket.com", "password": "LM2025!secure", "first_name": "Priya", "last_name": "Sharma", "position": "Product Manager", "teams": [{"name": "ecommerce", "roles": "team_user"}]}}
{"type": "user", "user": {"username": "david.liu", "email": "david.liu@leesmarket.com", "password": "LM2025!secure", "first_name": "David", "last_name": "Liu", "position": "VP Digital Operations", "teams": [{"name": "ecommerce", "roles": "team_admin"}]}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "ecommerce", "channel": "personalization", "user": "jennifer.chen", "message": "Hey team! Just pulled the Q1 numbers on our recommendation engine performance. Pretty excited to share these with everyone \ud83c\udf89", "create_at": 1744192800000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "ecommerce", "channel": "personalization", "user": "marcus.wong", "message": "Nice! What are we looking at?", "create_at": 1744193100000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "ecommerce", "channel": "personalization", "user": "jennifer.chen", "message": "So over the past 12 months, **38% of our online customers** have engaged with personalized product recommendations. That's a solid chunk of our user base!", "create_at": 1744193400000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "ecommerce", "channel": "personalization", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "That's great engagement! Do we have any data on how it's affecting purchase behavior?", "create_at": 1744193700000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "ecommerce", "channel": "personalization", "user": "jennifer.chen", "message": "Yep! Here's the best part - those customers who engage with recommendations are contributing to a **19% increase in average order value**. The cross-selling on Asian pantry staples and fresh seafood bundles is really working.", "create_at": 1744194000000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "ecommerce", "channel": "personalization", "user": "marcus.wong", "message": "Wow, 19% AOV lift is huge. That validates all the work we put into the recommendation algorithm last year. The \"frequently bought together\" feature for hot pot ingredients was a game changer.", "create_at": 1744194300000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "ecommerce", "channel": "personalization", "user": "david.liu", "message": "This is fantastic news team. Can we put together a summary deck for the leadership meeting next week? These numbers will help justify expanding the personalization budget for H2.", "create_at": 1744194600000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "ecommerce", "channel": "personalization", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "Absolutely! I'll draft something. Should we also include plans for the mobile app recommendations rollout?", "create_at": 1744194900000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "ecommerce", "channel": "personalization", "user": "david.liu", "message": "Yes please. If 38% engagement is driving these results on web, imagine what we could do with push notifications on mobile.", "create_at": 1744195200000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "ecommerce", "channel": "personalization", "user": "jennifer.chen", "message": "On it! I'll loop in the mobile team tomorrow. Great work everyone \ud83d\udc4f", "create_at": 1744195500000}}

