{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-experience", "channel": "support-metrics", "user": "jennifer.wong", "message": "Hey team, just pulled the Q1 2024 complaint resolution data. Wanted to share the numbers with everyone.", "create_at": 1718193600000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-experience", "channel": "support-metrics", "user": "jennifer.wong", "message": "| Metric | Q1 2024 Result |\n|--------|----------------|\n| Avg Time-to-Resolution | 3.5 hours |\n| Total Complaints | 2,847 |\n| Resolution Rate | 94.2% |", "create_at": 1718193660000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-experience", "channel": "support-metrics", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "3.5 hours average time-to-resolution for customer complaints isn't terrible, but I think we can do better. What's driving the longer cases?", "create_at": 1718193900000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-experience", "channel": "support-metrics", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "From what I've seen, delivery issues and fresh produce quality complaints take the longest. Those require coordination with store managers and logistics.", "create_at": 1718194200000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-experience", "channel": "support-metrics", "user": "david.kim", "message": "Makes sense. Our online grocery orders have been growing fast. The 3.5 hours is actually dragging down customer satisfaction scores.", "create_at": 1718194500000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-experience", "channel": "support-metrics", "user": "jennifer.wong", "message": "Exactly. This indicates a need for process improvements to enhance customer satisfaction. I'm thinking we need better escalation workflows.", "create_at": 1718194800000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-experience", "channel": "support-metrics", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "What if we gave frontline agents more authority to issue refunds up to $50 without manager approval? That alone could shave off 30-45 mins on smaller complaints.", "create_at": 1718195100000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-experience", "channel": "support-metrics", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "Love that idea. Also we should look at dedicated support reps for our bakery and prepared foods complaints - those are time sensitive with HACCP compliance concerns.", "create_at": 1718195400000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-experience", "channel": "support-metrics", "user": "jennifer.wong", "message": "Great suggestions! Let's target getting that average down to 2.5 hours by Q2 2025. I'll draft a proposal for leadership this week.", "create_at": 1718195700000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-experience", "channel": "support-metrics", "user": "david.kim", "message": "Sounds good. Happy to help with the training materials if we roll out new procedures \ud83d\udc4d", "create_at": 1718196000000}}

