{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "security-ops", "channel": "incident-response", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "Data breaches in Q2 2025 cost MediConn approximately $3.4 million. This includes incident response, legal fees, regulatory fines, and customer notification expenses.", "create_at": 1726301400000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "security-ops", "channel": "incident-response", "user": "david.thompson", "message": "That's a significant hit to our operating budget. Can you break down the major cost drivers?", "create_at": 1726301700000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "security-ops", "channel": "incident-response", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "Sure. Roughly $1.2M in regulatory penalties under PIPEDA, $900K for forensic investigation and remediation, $800K in legal counsel, and $500K for patient notification and credit monitoring services.", "create_at": 1726302000000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "security-ops", "channel": "incident-response", "user": "elena.kovacs", "message": "The PIPEDA penalties were steep. The Commissioner's office wasn't pleased with the delay in breach notification. We need to tighten our response protocols.", "create_at": 1726302300000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "security-ops", "channel": "incident-response", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "Agreed. I'm recommending we implement automated breach detection alerts. The phishing vector that caused the April incident took 72 hours to identify.", "create_at": 1726302600000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "security-ops", "channel": "incident-response", "user": "david.thompson", "message": "What's the proposed investment for enhanced security measures?", "create_at": 1726302900000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "security-ops", "channel": "incident-response", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "We're looking at $450K for advanced threat detection and staff training. Given the $3.4M impact this quarter alone, the ROI case is clear.", "create_at": 1726303200000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "security-ops", "channel": "incident-response", "user": "elena.kovacs", "message": "I'll prepare the ISO 27001 alignment documentation. This will help demonstrate our commitment to continuous improvement during audits.", "create_at": 1726303500000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "security-ops", "channel": "incident-response", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "Perfect. Let's schedule a follow-up for Monday to finalize the board presentation. Thanks everyone.", "create_at": 1726303800000}}

