{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "product-development", "channel": "patient-experience", "user": "rachel.wong", "message": "Hey team! Just finished compiling the Q3 2024 patient experience report. Some really interesting insights to share.", "create_at": 1731772800000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "product-development", "channel": "patient-experience", "user": "daniel.patel", "message": "Great timing @rachel.wong! We have the roadmap planning meeting next week. What are the highlights?", "create_at": 1731773100000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "product-development", "channel": "patient-experience", "user": "rachel.wong", "message": "The big one: **76% of patients preferred mobile access** for virtual healthcare services in Q1 2024. This trend has been consistently strong throughout the year.", "create_at": 1731773400000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "product-development", "channel": "patient-experience", "user": "maria.santos", "message": "That's huge! Validates all the mobile-first work we've been doing. Are we seeing similar numbers for mental health counseling specifically?", "create_at": 1731773700000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "product-development", "channel": "patient-experience", "user": "rachel.wong", "message": "Yes, mental health services show even higher mobile preference at around 82%. Patients value the privacy and convenience of accessing therapy from their phones.", "create_at": 1731774000000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "product-development", "channel": "patient-experience", "user": "kevin.liu", "message": "This aligns perfectly with our 2025 strategy. @maria.santos how's the new iOS appointment booking feature coming along?", "create_at": 1731774300000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "product-development", "channel": "patient-experience", "user": "maria.santos", "message": "On track for December release. With 76% mobile preference, we're prioritizing push notifications for prescription delivery updates too.", "create_at": 1731774600000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "product-development", "channel": "patient-experience", "user": "daniel.patel", "message": "Excellent work everyone. @rachel.wong can you share the full report in our shared drive? I want to present these findings to the corporate wellness team.", "create_at": 1731774900000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "product-development", "channel": "patient-experience", "user": "rachel.wong", "message": "Already uploaded! The SME clients especially love mobile access for their employees. Makes our PIPEDA compliance even more critical on mobile.", "create_at": 1731775200000}}

