{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "engineering", "channel": "quality-assurance", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "Team, I've just finished compiling the Q1 2024 bug analysis report. We need to discuss some concerning findings.", "create_at": 1714128000000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "engineering", "channel": "quality-assurance", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "Sure, what did you find? We've been seeing a lot of tickets coming in from the infotainment side.", "create_at": 1714128300000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "engineering", "channel": "quality-assurance", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "You're right to notice that. **52% of our software bugs in Q1 2024 were related to user experience and interface issues.** This is a significant area for improvement.", "create_at": 1714128600000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "engineering", "channel": "quality-assurance", "user": "david.martinez", "message": "52%? That's over half our bugs. Is this mainly from the dashboard UI or the mobile app?", "create_at": 1714128900000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "engineering", "channel": "quality-assurance", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "Both, actually. The in-vehicle touchscreen accounts for about 35%, and the Elexion Connect app makes up the remaining 17%. Navigation flow and button responsiveness are the top complaints.", "create_at": 1714129200000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "engineering", "channel": "quality-assurance", "user": "jessica.nguyen", "message": "This really indicates we need to revamp our testing processes. Are we doing enough usability testing before release?", "create_at": 1714129500000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "engineering", "channel": "quality-assurance", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "I think our automated tests are solid for functionality, but we're definitely lacking in UX-focused test scenarios. We should consider adding more user journey testing.", "create_at": 1714129800000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "engineering", "channel": "quality-assurance", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "Agreed. I'm proposing we bring in a dedicated UX QA specialist and implement more comprehensive UI regression testing. I'll present this to leadership next week.", "create_at": 1714130100000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "engineering", "channel": "quality-assurance", "user": "david.martinez", "message": "Good call. With ISO 26262 compliance requirements, we can't afford interface issues affecting driver safety features. Let me know if you need supporting data.", "create_at": 1714130400000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "engineering", "channel": "quality-assurance", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "Thanks David. I'll share the full report in the shared drive. Let's target reducing UX-related bugs significantly by Q3.", "create_at": 1714130700000}}

