{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "store-operations", "channel": "labeling-efficiency", "user": "david.chen", "message": "So we're looking at roughly 3,800+ staff hours monthly across all Lee's Market locations just on label changes? That's a huge operational cost.", "create_at": 1689942300000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "store-operations", "channel": "labeling-efficiency", "user": "monica.tran", "message": "Exactly. And with our expansion plans, this doesn't scale well. I'm putting together a proposal for electronic shelf labels for the next budget cycle.", "create_at": 1689942600000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "store-operations", "channel": "labeling-efficiency", "user": "james.park", "message": "ESLs would be a game changer. Richmond HQ piloted those right?", "create_at": 1689942900000}}
