{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-experience", "channel": "support-ops", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "Team, I just finished reviewing the Q4 2024 customer satisfaction survey results. We need to discuss some concerning findings.", "create_at": 1745492400000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-experience", "channel": "support-ops", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "What did you find? We knew hold times were higher than we wanted last quarter.", "create_at": 1745492580000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-experience", "channel": "support-ops", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "It's worse than expected. 31% of customers who couldn't reach a support agent said they won't shop at Lee's Market again. That's a significant churn risk.", "create_at": 1745492760000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-experience", "channel": "support-ops", "user": "jessica.liu", "message": "That's really concerning. We've been understaffed since November. Peak hours are brutal - customers wait 15+ minutes sometimes.", "create_at": 1745492940000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-experience", "channel": "support-ops", "user": "david.wong", "message": "I ran the numbers from the sales side. If this trend continues, we're looking at a potential loss of 0.9% in future sales. With our revenue, that's millions of dollars at stake.", "create_at": 1745493120000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-experience", "channel": "support-ops", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "Do we have the budget for additional hiring? We've been asking for more agents since Q3.", "create_at": 1745493300000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-experience", "channel": "support-ops", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "I'm presenting these findings to leadership next week. The evidence clearly shows that insufficient call agents could hurt our bottom line. David, can you prepare a summary of the sales impact calculations?", "create_at": 1745493480000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-experience", "channel": "support-ops", "user": "david.wong", "message": "Absolutely. I'll have a full breakdown ready by Monday showing the correlation between support accessibility and customer retention.", "create_at": 1745493660000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-experience", "channel": "support-ops", "user": "jessica.liu", "message": "In the meantime, I'll see if we can optimize shift schedules to better cover peak times. It's not a permanent solution, but it might help.", "create_at": 1745493840000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-experience", "channel": "support-ops", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "Good plan. We need to act fast - our customers in Richmond and across our urban locations expect better from us.", "create_at": 1745494020000}}

