{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-operations", "channel": "helpdesk-improvements", "user": "kevin.wong", "message": "Hey team, wanted to touch base on the February internal IT reports. The numbers are pretty rough.", "create_at": 1734192000000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-operations", "channel": "helpdesk-improvements", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "Yeah I saw those. Afaik employees are spending like 7 hours a week or something just tracking IT requests manually? That's insane.", "create_at": 1734192180000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-operations", "channel": "helpdesk-improvements", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "Last I heard it was around 7.2 hours per week on average. This is happening across all our regions - Vancouver, LA, Toronto stores are all dealing with it.", "create_at": 1734192360000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-operations", "channel": "helpdesk-improvements", "user": "diana.foster", "message": "The core issue seems to be that we don't have any automated workflow for prioritizing or assigning tasks. Everything's done manually in spreadsheets still.", "create_at": 1734192540000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-operations", "channel": "helpdesk-improvements", "user": "kevin.wong", "message": "Exactly. With 5000+ employees across all Lee's Market locations, the manual tracking is creating major inefficiencies. We need to address this ASAP.", "create_at": 1734192720000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-operations", "channel": "helpdesk-improvements", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "I think the February report might have some recommendations? Not 100% sure but there was talk about implementing ServiceNow or something similar.", "create_at": 1734192900000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-operations", "channel": "helpdesk-improvements", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "That would help. Right now requests just sit in email queues and nobody knows who's handling what. No wonder it takes so long.", "create_at": 1734193080000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-operations", "channel": "helpdesk-improvements", "user": "diana.foster", "message": "Should we put together a proposal for automated ticketing? I can pull the data from the Feb reports to support it.", "create_at": 1734193260000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-operations", "channel": "helpdesk-improvements", "user": "kevin.wong", "message": "Yes please. Let's schedule a call next week to review options. This inefficiency is costing us way too much productivity across regions.", "create_at": 1734193440000}}

