{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-operations", "channel": "incident-management", "user": "kevin.wu", "message": "Hey team, just got out of the Q1 review meeting. Leadership is asking why our incident resolution times are climbing. Anyone have insights?", "create_at": 1712246400000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-operations", "channel": "incident-management", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "I heard from someone on the Vancouver team that the ITSM tracker showed resolution time went up like 47% or something? Not totally sure on the exact number but it sounds about right.", "create_at": 1712247000000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-operations", "channel": "incident-management", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "That tracks with what I've been seeing. The BC stores use a completely different ticketing system than the California locations. Makes it really hard to share knowledge.", "create_at": 1712247300000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-operations", "channel": "incident-management", "user": "jessica.tran", "message": "Yeah, I think I remember someone mentioning that each region basically does their own thing? Like the incident and change management processes aren't standardized or something.", "create_at": 1712247600000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-operations", "channel": "incident-management", "user": "kevin.wu", "message": "That's frustrating. So we've got separate IT systems across regions AND inconsistent communication between teams?", "create_at": 1712248200000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-operations", "channel": "incident-management", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "Pretty much. I was talking to Mike in the Texas region last week and he didn't even know we had a major POS outage in Ontario. No standard escalation path.", "create_at": 1712248500000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-operations", "channel": "incident-management", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "We really need unified ITSM processes. Problem management, change management - all of it should be consistent across all Lee's Market stores.", "create_at": 1712249100000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-operations", "channel": "incident-management", "user": "jessica.tran", "message": "Agreed. Maybe we can propose a centralized platform at the next ops meeting? This fragmentation is killing our resolution times.", "create_at": 1712249400000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-operations", "channel": "incident-management", "user": "kevin.wu", "message": "Good idea. I'll draft a proposal. Let's aim to get everyone on the same page before Q2 numbers get worse.", "create_at": 1712250000000}}

