{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-operations", "channel": "service-desk-analytics", "user": "kevin.nguyen", "message": "Great input everyone. Patricia, can you put together a summary report with the March 2026 data? We'll present to management next week.", "create_at": 1738255200000}}
