{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "compliance", "channel": "us-expansion", "user": "daniel.chen", "message": "Just wrapped up the internal assessment last week. The state-by-state requirements are honestly a nightmare compared to PIPEDA.", "create_at": 1706621100000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "compliance", "channel": "us-expansion", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "Yeah I've been deep in the weeds on this. Pretty sure we're looking at a really long runway here. Each state has different rules for cash-only patients and their data.", "create_at": 1706621400000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "compliance", "channel": "us-expansion", "user": "marcus.wong", "message": "From legal's perspective, we can't cut corners. California alone has CCPA plus specific healthcare provisions. Then you've got Texas, New York, etc.", "create_at": 1706621700000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "compliance", "channel": "us-expansion", "user": "rachel.torres", "message": "So what's the realistic timeline? Board wants actual numbers.", "create_at": 1706622000000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "compliance", "channel": "us-expansion", "user": "daniel.chen", "message": "Based on our projections, I think we're looking at Q3 2028 at the earliest for full compliance across all US states. That's being optimistic tbh.", "create_at": 1706622300000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "compliance", "channel": "us-expansion", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "Afaik that lines up with what we modeled. The cash-only patient privacy stuff is particularly tricky since regulations keep evolving.", "create_at": 1706622600000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "compliance", "channel": "us-expansion", "user": "marcus.wong", "message": "Last I heard from our external consultants, they agreed with that timeline. Maybe even conservative.", "create_at": 1706622900000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "compliance", "channel": "us-expansion", "user": "rachel.torres", "message": "Q3 2028... that's over 4 years out. Leadership won't love that but better to be accurate. Can you send me the full projection doc Daniel?", "create_at": 1706623200000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "compliance", "channel": "us-expansion", "user": "daniel.chen", "message": "Will do. I'll flag it as internal only obviously. We could potentially do a phased rollout starting with less complex states but full nationwide compliance is Q3 2028.", "create_at": 1706623500000}}

