{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-operations", "channel": "service-desk-metrics", "user": "daniel.chen", "message": "Hey team, I've been reviewing the Q3 2025 data to identify patterns in ticket resolution times. Anyone else notice specific pain points across our regions?", "create_at": 1737028800000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-operations", "channel": "service-desk-metrics", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "Yeah I was actually chatting with Kevin from the Vancouver DC yesterday. He mentioned something from the Q2 2026 internal performance report - pretty sure he said service desk requests spike by like 65% on Tuesdays and Thursdays around 2 p.m.", "create_at": 1737029100000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-operations", "channel": "service-desk-metrics", "user": "marcus.wong", "message": "That matches what I've heard too. I think the resolution times jump up significantly during those windows - something like 6 hours longer when the self-service guidance isn't clear enough for staff to follow.", "create_at": 1737029400000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-operations", "channel": "service-desk-metrics", "user": "jessica.tran", "message": "Makes sense. Those are usually shift overlap times at our stores. POS systems get hammered during afternoon rush and employees can't troubleshoot on their own.", "create_at": 1737029700000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-operations", "channel": "service-desk-metrics", "user": "daniel.chen", "message": "Good point Jessica. So we're looking at a combination of peak traffic AND inadequate self-service documentation. Should we propose enhanced KB articles for common POS issues?", "create_at": 1737030000000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-operations", "channel": "service-desk-metrics", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "I think so. We could also consider adding dedicated support staff coverage during those Tue/Thu afternoon windows. The stores in Richmond and Seattle seem to be hit hardest from what I've heard.", "create_at": 1737030300000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-operations", "channel": "service-desk-metrics", "user": "marcus.wong", "message": "Let me pull together a proposal for the leadership meeting next week. We need to address this before Q3 holiday prep kicks in.", "create_at": 1737030600000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-operations", "channel": "service-desk-metrics", "user": "daniel.chen", "message": "Perfect. Include the staffing recommendations and KB improvements. Thanks everyone! \ud83d\udc4d", "create_at": 1737030900000}}

