{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-operations", "channel": "helpdesk-metrics", "user": "kevin.chen", "message": "Hey team, just finished pulling the Q2 internal logs for our self-service IT resolution analysis. We need to identify what's taking employees the longest to fix on their own.", "create_at": 1725984000000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-operations", "channel": "helpdesk-metrics", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "Nice! What are you seeing so far? I've been hearing complaints from the warehouse staff about connectivity problems.", "create_at": 1725984300000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-operations", "channel": "helpdesk-metrics", "user": "kevin.chen", "message": "VPN connectivity issues are by far the worst. Employees are averaging **3.1 hours per incident** trying to resolve these on their own. That's way higher than anything else.", "create_at": 1725984600000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-operations", "channel": "helpdesk-metrics", "user": "marcus.williams", "message": "3.1 hours?? That's insane. What's causing the delay?", "create_at": 1725984900000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-operations", "channel": "helpdesk-metrics", "user": "kevin.chen", "message": "Looks like it's our outdated troubleshooting documentation. People are following guides that reference old VPN clients and deprecated settings. They go in circles before giving up and calling us.", "create_at": 1725985200000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-operations", "channel": "helpdesk-metrics", "user": "jennifer.tran", "message": "That makes sense. I updated the main VPN doc back in January but there are like 5 other KB articles floating around that still point to the old Cisco AnyConnect setup.", "create_at": 1725985500000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-operations", "channel": "helpdesk-metrics", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "We should consolidate those and maybe add a video walkthrough. Store managers especially struggle with this stuff.", "create_at": 1725985800000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-operations", "channel": "helpdesk-metrics", "user": "kevin.chen", "message": "Agreed. I'll flag this in Friday's ops review. If we can get VPN self-resolution down to under an hour, that's huge productivity gains across all 5000 employees. @jennifer.tran can you own the doc cleanup?", "create_at": 1725986100000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-operations", "channel": "helpdesk-metrics", "user": "jennifer.tran", "message": "On it! I'll have a draft consolidated guide by end of week \ud83d\udc4d", "create_at": 1725986400000}}

