{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-experience", "channel": "chatbot-analytics", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "I was looking at this yesterday. Pretty sure around 52% of customers who started with the chatbot ended up requesting a human agent. That's from the July 15th data pull.", "create_at": 1736520300000}}
