{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-experience", "channel": "chatbot-analytics", "user": "jennifer.wong", "message": "Hey team, just finished pulling together the latest numbers on our AI chatbot escalations. Leadership wants a full report by end of week.", "create_at": 1735480800000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-experience", "channel": "chatbot-analytics", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "Perfect timing. What are we looking at for the human handoff rate?", "create_at": 1735481100000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-experience", "channel": "chatbot-analytics", "user": "jennifer.wong", "message": "So according to our November data, 26% of clients asked for human assistance even when they initially started with the chatbot. That's across all channels - online orders, delivery inquiries, store questions.", "create_at": 1735481400000}}
