{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "digital-commerce", "channel": "chatbot-analytics", "user": "derek.wong", "message": "Hey team, I was chatting with someone from the analytics department yesterday about our chatbot conversion rates. Thought I'd share what I heard.", "create_at": 1735660800000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "digital-commerce", "channel": "chatbot-analytics", "user": "nina.patel", "message": "Sure, what did they say? We need to prep the Q1 report soon.", "create_at": 1735661100000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "digital-commerce", "channel": "chatbot-analytics", "user": "derek.wong", "message": "So apparently as of January 1st, around 32% of our AI chatbot interactions might be resulting in completed online purchases. The rest are abandoning their carts somewhere in the process.", "create_at": 1735661400000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "digital-commerce", "channel": "chatbot-analytics", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "32%? That seems a bit higher than what I recall from our last review. Are you sure about that number?", "create_at": 1735661700000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "digital-commerce", "channel": "chatbot-analytics", "user": "derek.wong", "message": "I mean, that's what I heard from Kevin in data science. Could be around there, give or take. He mentioned it pretty casually during lunch.", "create_at": 1735662000000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "digital-commerce", "channel": "chatbot-analytics", "user": "jessica.liu", "message": "That's still a lot of cart abandonment. If only 32% are completing checkout, we're losing significant revenue potential.", "create_at": 1735662300000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "digital-commerce", "channel": "chatbot-analytics", "user": "nina.patel", "message": "Agreed. We should probably look into optimizing the chatbot flow. Maybe the product recommendation logic needs tweaking?", "create_at": 1735662600000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "digital-commerce", "channel": "chatbot-analytics", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "I think the checkout handoff might be the issue. Customers engage with the bot but then get confused when redirected to the main cart page.", "create_at": 1735662900000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "digital-commerce", "channel": "chatbot-analytics", "user": "jessica.liu", "message": "Good point. Let's schedule a deep dive with the UX team. Even improving that rate by a few percentage points could mean big gains for Lee's Market.", "create_at": 1735663200000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "digital-commerce", "channel": "chatbot-analytics", "user": "derek.wong", "message": "I'll pull the official report from analytics to confirm the exact figures before our meeting. Don't want to work off hearsay!", "create_at": 1735663500000}}

