{"type": "user", "user": {"username": "kevin.wong", "email": "kevin.wong@leesmarket.com", "password": "Lm$2026Secure!", "teams": [{"name": "digital-ops", "roles": "team_admin"}]}}
{"type": "user", "user": {"username": "priya.sharma", "email": "priya.sharma@leesmarket.com", "password": "Pr!ya2026Tech", "teams": [{"name": "digital-ops", "roles": "team_user"}]}}
{"type": "user", "user": {"username": "marcus.chen", "email": "marcus.chen@leesmarket.com", "password": "Marc$Chen2026", "teams": [{"name": "digital-ops", "roles": "team_user"}]}}
{"type": "user", "user": {"username": "lisa.tanaka", "email": "lisa.tanaka@leesmarket.com", "password": "L!saTan2026!", "teams": [{"name": "digital-ops", "roles": "team_user"}]}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "digital-ops", "channel": "chatbot-initiative", "user": "kevin.wong", "message": "Hey team, quick update on the chatbot roadmap. Had a call with the vendor yesterday and wanted to share what I heard.", "create_at": 1738857600000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "digital-ops", "channel": "chatbot-initiative", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "Great timing! We've been waiting on details. What's the timeline looking like?", "create_at": 1738857900000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "digital-ops", "channel": "chatbot-initiative", "user": "kevin.wong", "message": "So from what I gathered, pretty sure the full chatbot rollout is happening by Q3 2027. The bots will confirm items in cart, flag duplicate items, and guide customers through final order checks before checkout.", "create_at": 1738858200000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "digital-ops", "channel": "chatbot-initiative", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "That's later than I expected. I think someone mentioned Q1 2026 earlier. Any reason for the delay?", "create_at": 1738858500000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "digital-ops", "channel": "chatbot-initiative", "user": "kevin.wong", "message": "I think so, yeah. The integration with our existing POS and online ordering system is more complex than anticipated. At least that's what the project lead told me.", "create_at": 1738858800000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "digital-ops", "channel": "chatbot-initiative", "user": "lisa.tanaka", "message": "What about the expected impact? Customer service has been asking about refund rate improvements.", "create_at": 1738859100000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "digital-ops", "channel": "chatbot-initiative", "user": "kevin.wong", "message": "From what I heard, they're expecting to lower refunds by about 8% and cut order mistakes by around 25% within twelve months of launch. Those numbers came from the analytics team I believe.", "create_at": 1738859400000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "digital-ops", "channel": "chatbot-initiative", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "Not bad! The duplicate flagging alone should help a lot. We get so many calls about accidental double orders, especially during holiday rushes.", "create_at": 1738859700000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "digital-ops", "channel": "chatbot-initiative", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "Agreed. Will the chatbot support multiple languages? Our customer base really needs Mandarin and Cantonese options.", "create_at": 1738860000000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "digital-ops", "channel": "chatbot-initiative", "user": "kevin.wong", "message": "Pretty sure multilingual support is in scope but might come in a later phase. I'll confirm in our next sync.", "create_at": 1738860300000}}

