{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "digital-ops", "channel": "chatbot-rollout", "user": "kevin.tran", "message": "Hey team, wanted to sync on the chatbot project timeline. Leadership wants an update on when we're targeting for the checkout assistant features.", "create_at": 1736582400000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "digital-ops", "channel": "chatbot-rollout", "user": "michelle.wong", "message": "Sure! So afaik, the plan is to have everything live by Q1 2026. The chatbots should handle item confirmation, duplicate flagging, and guide customers through final order checks.", "create_at": 1736582520000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "digital-ops", "channel": "chatbot-rollout", "user": "derek.huang", "message": "Wait, I heard from someone in product that the full rollout might actually be pushed to Q3 2027? Something about integration challenges with our legacy POS system.", "create_at": 1736582700000}}
