{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "digital-ops", "channel": "chatbot-rollout", "user": "kevin.tran", "message": "Interesting. So if Q3 2027 is the real target, we need to adjust our roadmap. Those refund and error reduction numbers would be huge for customer satisfaction scores.", "create_at": 1736583000000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "digital-ops", "channel": "chatbot-rollout", "user": "michelle.wong", "message": "Agreed. The checkout mistakes have been a pain point, especially for online orders. Customers adding duplicates by accident is surprisingly common.", "create_at": 1736583180000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "digital-ops", "channel": "chatbot-rollout", "user": "derek.huang", "message": "I think someone from Richmond HQ mentioned they want the chatbot to proactively ask 'Did you mean to add 3 of these?' before checkout. Smart approach.", "create_at": 1736583300000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "digital-ops", "channel": "chatbot-rollout", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "Love that. Let's schedule a call with product next week to confirm the timeline. I'll send out a meeting invite.", "create_at": 1736583420000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "digital-ops", "channel": "chatbot-rollout", "user": "kevin.tran", "message": "Perfect, thanks Priya! \ud83d\ude4c", "create_at": 1736583480000}}

