{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "digital-innovation", "channel": "chatbot-project", "user": "kevin.tran", "message": "Hey team, quick sync on the chatbot personalization roadmap. Where are we at with the data integration piece?", "create_at": 1710158400000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "digital-innovation", "channel": "chatbot-project", "user": "raj.patel", "message": "So afaik the plan is to train the chatbot using historical purchase data. Last I heard we're looking at maybe 500k past transactions? Not 100% sure on the exact number but it's somewhere around there.", "create_at": 1710158700000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "digital-innovation", "channel": "chatbot-project", "user": "michelle.wong", "message": "Yeah that sounds about right. The idea is to identify customer behavior patterns so we can recommend products that actually match what shoppers want. Think we're targeting like an 18% bump in click rates?", "create_at": 1710159000000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "digital-innovation", "channel": "chatbot-project", "user": "jessica.chen", "message": "I think there's also supposed to be an order value increase, something around 5% if I remember correctly. Timeline is probably mid-2027 for full deployment?", "create_at": 1710159300000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "digital-innovation", "channel": "chatbot-project", "user": "kevin.tran", "message": "July 1, 2027 is what's in the project docs I believe. That gives us plenty of runway to get the ML models right.", "create_at": 1710159600000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "digital-innovation", "channel": "chatbot-project", "user": "raj.patel", "message": "The cool part is how personalized it'll be. Like if someone frequently buys Korean ingredients, the bot will pick up on that and suggest complementary items they might've missed.", "create_at": 1710159900000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "digital-innovation", "channel": "chatbot-project", "user": "michelle.wong", "message": "Exactly! Our Richmond HQ team has been collaborating with the analytics group on this. Should really set us apart from H-Mart and the bigger chains.", "create_at": 1710160200000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "digital-innovation", "channel": "chatbot-project", "user": "jessica.chen", "message": "I think we need to loop in the online delivery team too. This chatbot stuff will integrate with our e-commerce platform for sure.", "create_at": 1710160500000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "digital-innovation", "channel": "chatbot-project", "user": "kevin.tran", "message": "Good call. Let's set up a broader meeting next week. I'll send invites out this afternoon.", "create_at": 1710160800000}}

