{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "digital-products", "channel": "chatbot-dev", "user": "kevin.tran", "message": "Hey team, quick sync on the personalized recommendations roadmap. Where are we with the chatbot training data?", "create_at": 1712505600000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "digital-products", "channel": "chatbot-dev", "user": "michelle.wong", "message": "So afaik, we're on track to train the chatbot on data from over 500,000 past purchases. The data engineering team has been cleaning up the transaction logs since February.", "create_at": 1712505900000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "digital-products", "channel": "chatbot-dev", "user": "david.chen", "message": "That's right. The goal is to identify patterns in customer behavior so we can recommend products that actually match shopper preferences. Last I heard, we might hit the full dataset by mid-2027.", "create_at": 1712506200000}}
