{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "sales", "channel": "centennial-outreach", "user": "tom.nguyen", "message": "Live chat on the website is also catching customers who browse but don't buy. The AI suggests products they've looked at before with a small discount. Pretty seamless experience.", "create_at": 1745943360000}}
