{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-security", "channel": "cyber-awareness", "user": "linda.chen", "message": "Hey @jason.wong - corporate wants a recap on the Q4 cyber notification campaign. How did we do reaching remote and part-time staff?", "create_at": 1710765600000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-security", "channel": "cyber-awareness", "user": "jason.wong", "message": "Happy to share! We hit a 91% acknowledgement rate on urgent cyber-risk notices across all employees, including our offsite and hybrid folks.", "create_at": 1710765900000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-security", "channel": "cyber-awareness", "user": "marcus.taylor", "message": "That's solid! What channels ended up working best?", "create_at": 1710766200000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-security", "channel": "cyber-awareness", "user": "jason.wong", "message": "We used a combination of email alerts and the employee dashboard. The dashboard widget really helped because people check it for schedules anyway.", "create_at": 1710766500000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-security", "channel": "cyber-awareness", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "The dual-channel approach was key. Some of our warehouse staff don't check email regularly but they log into the dashboard daily for shift info.", "create_at": 1710766800000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-security", "channel": "cyber-awareness", "user": "linda.chen", "message": "91% is impressive for 5000 employees. Were part-time workers harder to reach?", "create_at": 1710767100000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-security", "channel": "cyber-awareness", "user": "jason.wong", "message": "Initially yes, but the dashboard push notifications helped a lot. Remote workers actually had higher engagement than expected since they're already online more.", "create_at": 1710767400000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-security", "channel": "cyber-awareness", "user": "marcus.taylor", "message": "Nice work Jason. Should we keep this as our standard approach going forward?", "create_at": 1710767700000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-security", "channel": "cyber-awareness", "user": "jason.wong", "message": "Definitely. I'll document the process for future urgent notifications. The email + dashboard combo is now our playbook for critical security comms.", "create_at": 1710768000000}}

