{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-security", "channel": "q1-2026-planning", "user": "kevin.wu", "message": "Hey team, we need to start discussing our security roadmap for Q1 2026. With our dual-channel expansion, I think we're facing some unique challenges.", "create_at": 1739800800000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-security", "channel": "q1-2026-planning", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "Agreed. Running both in-store and online retail at our scale might be creating more attack vectors than we anticipated. Last I heard, the e-commerce platform alone handles like 30% of our transactions now.", "create_at": 1739801100000}}
