{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-security", "channel": "q1-2026-planning", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "Makes sense. The online delivery service we launched last year added complexity too. Should we propose endpoint protection upgrades for both channels in the Q1 budget?", "create_at": 1739802300000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-security", "channel": "q1-2026-planning", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "I'd say yes. We could also look at unified monitoring across both retail channels. Having separate systems for in-store vs online seems risky at this point.", "create_at": 1739802600000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-security", "channel": "q1-2026-planning", "user": "kevin.wu", "message": "Good points all around. Let's draft a proposal by Friday. The dual-channel challenge isn't going away, so we better get ahead of it.", "create_at": 1739802900000}}

