{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-security", "channel": "cyber-risk-2026", "user": "david.nguyen", "message": "Exactly my concern. The handling of sensitive customer data at Lee's Market directly impacts our cyber risk profile going into 2026. We need tighter access controls and better monitoring.", "create_at": 1735143120000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-security", "channel": "cyber-risk-2026", "user": "rachel.kim", "message": "Should we propose mandatory quarterly phishing simulations? I've seen too many close calls at the Richmond HQ alone.", "create_at": 1735143300000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-security", "channel": "cyber-risk-2026", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "Agreed. Also thinking we need endpoint detection upgrades at our POS terminals. That's where most payment data gets processed.", "create_at": 1735143480000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-security", "channel": "cyber-risk-2026", "user": "jennifer.wong", "message": "I'll draft a budget proposal for the new training program and EDR rollout. Can we sync tomorrow at 2pm to review?", "create_at": 1735143660000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-security", "channel": "cyber-risk-2026", "user": "david.nguyen", "message": "Works for me. Let's get ahead of this before the new year. Thanks everyone \ud83d\udc4d", "create_at": 1735143840000}}

