{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "compliance-ops", "channel": "audit-reviews", "user": "jennifer.wong", "message": "Hey team, just finished compiling the 2025 compliance audit results. We need to discuss some patterns I noticed.", "create_at": 1745078400000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "compliance-ops", "channel": "audit-reviews", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "Sure thing. What came up? Anything related to the HACCP certifications?", "create_at": 1745078520000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "compliance-ops", "channel": "audit-reviews", "user": "jennifer.wong", "message": "Actually yes. I'm pretty sure there's a clear link between our compliance certifications and employee training gaps. The data suggests untrained employees might be responsible for around 35% of minor noncompliance findings.", "create_at": 1745078700000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "compliance-ops", "channel": "audit-reviews", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "That's concerning. Is this across all locations or specific stores?", "create_at": 1745078880000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "compliance-ops", "channel": "audit-reviews", "user": "jennifer.wong", "message": "It could be concentrated in newer locations, but I think it's pretty consistent chain-wide. Mostly FDA and CFIA food safety stuff - improper temperature logging, documentation errors.", "create_at": 1745079000000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "compliance-ops", "channel": "audit-reviews", "user": "david.tran", "message": "This makes sense. We've had high turnover in Q3-Q4 and onboarding might not have kept pace. @marcus.chen what's the current training completion rate?", "create_at": 1745079180000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "compliance-ops", "channel": "audit-reviews", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "I'd have to double-check, but I believe we're sitting around 72% completion for mandatory food safety modules. Some seasonal hires probably slipped through.", "create_at": 1745079360000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "compliance-ops", "channel": "audit-reviews", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "So essentially our certification compliance is being undermined by training gaps. We should probably implement a stricter no-floor-access policy until training is complete.", "create_at": 1745079540000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "compliance-ops", "channel": "audit-reviews", "user": "jennifer.wong", "message": "Agreed. I'll draft a proposal for the exec team. Thanks everyone!", "create_at": 1745079720000}}

