{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "security-ops", "channel": "incident-response", "user": "david.chen", "message": "Hey team, I'm pulling together the 2025 annual security report for leadership. Need to highlight how our IR training program performed. Anyone have the containment stats handy?", "create_at": 1736416800000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "security-ops", "channel": "incident-response", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "I was just looking at this yesterday! Pretty sure around 52% of breaches at our retail locations were contained within the first hour by trained employees.", "create_at": 1736417100000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "security-ops", "channel": "incident-response", "user": "marcus.wong", "message": "That sounds about right from what I remember. The clear incident protocols we rolled out really made a difference afaik. Employees knew exactly what steps to take.", "create_at": 1736417400000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "security-ops", "channel": "incident-response", "user": "jennifer.liu", "message": "I think so too. The Vancouver and Richmond stores especially showed strong numbers. Having those quick-reference cards at POS stations helped a lot.", "create_at": 1736417700000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "security-ops", "channel": "incident-response", "user": "david.chen", "message": "Great, thanks everyone. 52% first-hour containment is solid. That's a big improvement from 2024. The training investment really paid off.", "create_at": 1736418000000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "security-ops", "channel": "incident-response", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "Definitely. Last I heard, the US stores are catching up too since we expanded the program to California locations in Q3.", "create_at": 1736418300000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "security-ops", "channel": "incident-response", "user": "marcus.wong", "message": "Should we propose expanding the training hours for 2026? Given our 5000+ employees, even small improvements in response time save us a lot.", "create_at": 1736418600000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "security-ops", "channel": "incident-response", "user": "david.chen", "message": "Good thinking Marcus. I'll include that recommendation. The 52% containment rate by trained staff shows clear ROI on the incident response training program.", "create_at": 1736418900000}}

