{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-security", "channel": "security-initiatives", "user": "david.chen", "message": "Hey team, just got the Q1 2023 security metrics in. The MFA education rollout has been a massive success!", "create_at": 1687780800000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-security", "channel": "security-initiatives", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "That's great news David! What are we seeing in the numbers?", "create_at": 1687781100000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-security", "channel": "security-initiatives", "user": "david.chen", "message": "We're looking at a **45% drop in unauthorized access attempts** since we completed the staff-wide MFA education and adoption program. This aligns with what other retailers in our sector have been reporting.", "create_at": 1687781400000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-security", "channel": "security-initiatives", "user": "marcus.williams", "message": "Wow, that's impressive! The in-store training sessions really paid off. I remember we had some pushback initially from the warehouse teams.", "create_at": 1687781700000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-security", "channel": "security-initiatives", "user": "jennifer.tran", "message": "The key was making it practical. Once staff understood how multi-factor authentication protects their own accounts and customer data, adoption went through the roof. We hit 98% compliance across all 47 locations.", "create_at": 1687782000000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-security", "channel": "security-initiatives", "user": "david.chen", "message": "Exactly. The hands-on workshops where we showed real phishing examples targeting retail employees made it tangible. People got why just a password isn't enough anymore.", "create_at": 1687782300000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-security", "channel": "security-initiatives", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "Should we share these results with the executive team? This could help secure budget for the next phase of security awareness training.", "create_at": 1687782600000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-security", "channel": "security-initiatives", "user": "marcus.williams", "message": "Agreed. With our expansion plans across more urban centers, maintaining this security posture is critical. The 45% reduction speaks for itself.", "create_at": 1687782900000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-security", "channel": "security-initiatives", "user": "david.chen", "message": "I'll prepare a summary report for the leadership meeting Thursday. Great work everyone - this is a win for all of Lee's Market! \ud83c\udf89", "create_at": 1687783200000}}

