{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-security", "channel": "incident-response", "user": "jason.wong", "message": "Team, wanted to share the final results from our July phishing simulation exercise. Really proud of everyone's work on this.", "create_at": 1726848000000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-security", "channel": "incident-response", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "Thanks Jason! The cross-departmental coordination you led made a huge difference this time.", "create_at": 1726848180000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-security", "channel": "incident-response", "user": "jason.wong", "message": "Here's a quick summary:\n\n| Metric | Result |\n|--------|--------|\n| Campaign Type | Simulated Phishing |\n| Departments Involved | IT Helpdesk, SOC |\n| Avg Response Time | 18 minutes |\n| Escalation Success | 94% |", "create_at": 1726848360000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-security", "channel": "incident-response", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "18 minutes average response is excellent! That's a significant improvement from previous exercises. Having both helpdesk and SOC looped in simultaneously really streamlined things.", "create_at": 1726848540000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-security", "channel": "incident-response", "user": "linda.tran", "message": "Agreed. Jason, your coordination between the teams was key. The shared Slack bridge with SOC for real-time updates helped us at helpdesk triage faster.", "create_at": 1726848720000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-security", "channel": "incident-response", "user": "jason.wong", "message": "Thanks everyone. The goal was to break down silos between IT helpdesk and security ops. When employees report suspicious emails, we need both teams aligned immediately.", "create_at": 1726848900000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-security", "channel": "incident-response", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "Should we document this as our standard playbook for future phishing responses? This model could scale well across all 5000+ employees.", "create_at": 1726849080000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-security", "channel": "incident-response", "user": "jason.wong", "message": "Absolutely. I'll draft an updated SOP this week. We'll use this July exercise as the benchmark. Let's schedule a Q4 drill to maintain readiness.", "create_at": 1726849260000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-security", "channel": "incident-response", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "Sounds good. Great leadership on this one, Jason. \ud83d\udc4f", "create_at": 1726849440000}}

