{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "compliance-ops", "channel": "audit-review", "user": "jason.wong", "message": "Hey team, just got out of the regulatory audit debrief. We need to talk about what they found.", "create_at": 1732540800000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "compliance-ops", "channel": "audit-review", "user": "michelle.chen", "message": "How bad is it? I heard there were some issues with vendor documentation.", "create_at": 1732541100000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "compliance-ops", "channel": "audit-review", "user": "jason.wong", "message": "So the November 2026 regulatory audit identified seven process gaps specifically in our vendor data sharing logs. Pretty sure this is what pushed us to rethink our whole approach.", "create_at": 1732541400000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "compliance-ops", "channel": "audit-review", "user": "derek.patel", "message": "Seven gaps? That's more than I expected. Were they all related to the same vendor processes?", "create_at": 1732541700000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "compliance-ops", "channel": "audit-review", "user": "jason.wong", "message": "Mostly yes - the auditors flagged inconsistencies in how we log data exchanges with third-party suppliers. I think this might be connected to the compliance improvements we made back in Q2 2025, but honestly I'm not 100% certain about the timeline.", "create_at": 1732542000000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "compliance-ops", "channel": "audit-review", "user": "anna.liu", "message": "So what's the plan going forward? Are we handling remediation internally?", "create_at": 1732542300000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "compliance-ops", "channel": "audit-review", "user": "jason.wong", "message": "That's actually what I wanted to discuss. Given these findings, I'm reviewing external compliance support options. Could be beneficial to bring in specialists who deal with CFIA and FDA requirements regularly.", "create_at": 1732542600000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "compliance-ops", "channel": "audit-review", "user": "michelle.chen", "message": "Makes sense. Our vendor network has grown significantly with the new distribution centers. External support might help us scale compliance properly.", "create_at": 1732542900000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "compliance-ops", "channel": "audit-review", "user": "derek.patel", "message": "I think so too. Do you want me to pull together a list of potential consultants with retail food compliance experience?", "create_at": 1732543200000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "compliance-ops", "channel": "audit-review", "user": "jason.wong", "message": "Yes please, Derek. Let's schedule a deeper review meeting for Friday. We need to address these gaps before the follow-up inspection.", "create_at": 1732543500000}}

