{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "compliance", "channel": "audit-tracking", "user": "mei.chen", "message": "Hey team, just got out of a call with someone from the Vancouver office. Apparently there was a regulatory audit back in February that didn't go so well?", "create_at": 1734782400000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "compliance", "channel": "audit-tracking", "user": "derek.patel", "message": "Yeah I heard something about that too. From what I understand, they found like seven process gaps or something? Mostly around vendor data sharing logs apparently.", "create_at": 1734782700000}}
