{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "operations", "channel": "security-compliance", "user": "marcus.wong", "message": "This is huge. I was just reading that companies with zero major security incidents in 2025 are citing exactly that - 97% staff cyber training completion. We're right on target.", "create_at": 1731851400000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "operations", "channel": "security-compliance", "user": "jennifer.liu", "message": "From the store level perspective, I can tell you the training has really changed how my team handles customer data. They're way more careful with POS systems now.", "create_at": 1731851700000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "operations", "channel": "security-compliance", "user": "david.chen", "message": "Exactly Jennifer. And this directly ties into our reputation protection strategy. One data breach could devastate the trust we've built with our diverse customer base.", "create_at": 1731852000000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "operations", "channel": "security-compliance", "user": "marcus.wong", "message": "Spot on. Our customers in Asian communities across the U.S. and Canada trust us with their info for online orders and delivery. We can't afford to lose that.", "create_at": 1731852300000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "operations", "channel": "security-compliance", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "The relationship between reputation protection and staff training is basically everything for us. Trained staff = fewer incidents = customer trust retained.", "create_at": 1731852600000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "operations", "channel": "security-compliance", "user": "jennifer.liu", "message": "Plus our customers are really loyal. They've been shopping with us since 2003. We owe it to them to keep their data safe.", "create_at": 1731852900000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "operations", "channel": "security-compliance", "user": "david.chen", "message": "Agreed. Let's keep pushing for that last 3% completion. I'll send out reminders to outstanding locations today.", "create_at": 1731853200000}}

