{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-security", "channel": "web-security", "user": "david.chen", "message": "Hey team, just finished pulling the August web traffic analysis. Got some concerning numbers we need to discuss.", "create_at": 1694520000000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-security", "channel": "web-security", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "What are you seeing David? Been monitoring some suspicious patterns on the CDN logs myself.", "create_at": 1694520180000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-security", "channel": "web-security", "user": "david.chen", "message": "Security logs revealed that 12% of inbound web requests in August 2023 originated from flagged, potentially malicious IPs. That's a significant jump from July.", "create_at": 1694520300000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-security", "channel": "web-security", "user": "marcus.wong", "message": "12%?? That's way higher than our baseline. Are we seeing actual attack attempts or just bot traffic from sketchy sources?", "create_at": 1694520480000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-security", "channel": "web-security", "user": "david.chen", "message": "Mix of both. Seeing credential stuffing attempts against customer login, plus some probing on our checkout API endpoints. The online grocery platform is getting hammered.", "create_at": 1694520600000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-security", "channel": "web-security", "user": "jennifer.liu", "message": "This is concerning. With our expansion into more urban centers, we're becoming a bigger target. What's our plan to reduce this untrusted traffic percentage?", "create_at": 1694520900000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-security", "channel": "web-security", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "I'd recommend implementing stricter rate limiting and expanding our IP reputation blocklist. We can also add CAPTCHA challenges for flagged sources.", "create_at": 1694521080000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-security", "channel": "web-security", "user": "marcus.wong", "message": "Agreed. Also should consider geo-blocking for regions we don't actually serve. No reason to accept traffic from certain high-risk countries.", "create_at": 1694521200000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-security", "channel": "web-security", "user": "david.chen", "message": "Good ideas. I'll draft a remediation proposal for leadership review by EOD Thursday. Let's aim to get that 12% down significantly before the holiday shopping rush.", "create_at": 1694521380000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-security", "channel": "web-security", "user": "jennifer.liu", "message": "Perfect. Keep me posted on the proposal. We need to protect our customers' data - that's non-negotiable for Lee's Market.", "create_at": 1694521500000}}

