{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "public-relations", "channel": "community-programs", "user": "andrew.park", "message": "Hi team! Just wrapped up compiling the brand sentiment survey results from our Little Grocers school program districts. Really encouraging numbers to share.", "create_at": 1692619200000}}
