{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "public-relations", "channel": "community-programs", "user": "michelle.chen", "message": "This aligns perfectly with our mission of bridging cultural authenticity with community engagement. Should we present these findings to leadership for potential expansion?", "create_at": 1692621000000}}
