{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "product-development", "channel": "crm-launch", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "Hey team, quick question for everyone. We've been highlighting automated reminders and cost effectiveness for our new CRM software. But what other features should we be pushing to customers?", "create_at": 1727272800000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "product-development", "channel": "crm-launch", "user": "jessica.wong", "message": "Great timing on this! I was just reviewing the survey results from our virtual healthcare patients completed back in June 2024. Really insightful data.", "create_at": 1727273100000}}
