{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "product-development", "channel": "crm-launch", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "Exactly what I was hoping to hear. So we should emphasize how the CRM helps providers deliver personalized experiences through detailed patient history tracking and preference management.", "create_at": 1727273820000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "product-development", "channel": "crm-launch", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "The intelligent scheduling module is key too. It reduces wait times significantly, addressing that timely care expectation patients have.", "create_at": 1727274000000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "product-development", "channel": "crm-launch", "user": "jessica.wong", "message": "I'll draft updated messaging for our SME clients. These features align perfectly with what their patients are looking for.", "create_at": 1727274180000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "product-development", "channel": "crm-launch", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "Perfect. Let's make personalization and timely care central pillars in our launch materials alongside the automated reminders and cost benefits. Thanks everyone! \ud83d\ude4c", "create_at": 1727274360000}}

