{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "operations", "channel": "crm-evaluation", "user": "marie.bouchard", "message": "Hey team, as we plan for 2026 growth, I need us to finalize our CRM requirements. Being based in Canada, we have some unique considerations.", "create_at": 1733558400000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "operations", "channel": "crm-evaluation", "user": "daniel.chen", "message": "Good timing! I was chatting with someone from compliance last week and they mentioned there are specific Canadian CRM requirements we need to follow. I think these were established fully back in January 2016 by the government.", "create_at": 1733558520000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "operations", "channel": "crm-evaluation", "user": "kevin.wright", "message": "Right, I heard something similar from our legal team. Pretty sure there are 4 main requirements we need to hit.", "create_at": 1733558700000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "operations", "channel": "crm-evaluation", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "Can you break those down? I want to make sure our vendor shortlist covers everything.", "create_at": 1733558820000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "operations", "channel": "crm-evaluation", "user": "kevin.wright", "message": "From what I recall: attention to all legal compliance is the big one, then patient data must be stored within Canadian borders. There's also the bilingual requirement - info needs to be available in both French and English.", "create_at": 1733559000000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "operations", "channel": "crm-evaluation", "user": "daniel.chen", "message": "And I think the fourth one is mandatory data breach notification protocols. Makes sense given we handle sensitive healthcare data.", "create_at": 1733559180000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "operations", "channel": "crm-evaluation", "user": "marie.bouchard", "message": "These all align with our PIPEDA compliance needs. The data residency requirement is crucial - several US-based CRM vendors won't work for us.", "create_at": 1733559360000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "operations", "channel": "crm-evaluation", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "Good to know. I'll update our evaluation criteria document. The French/English requirement will narrow our options quite a bit.", "create_at": 1733559540000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "operations", "channel": "crm-evaluation", "user": "marie.bouchard", "message": "Perfect. Let's schedule a call with vendors next week to confirm they meet all four requirements before we move forward.", "create_at": 1733559720000}}

