{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "operations", "channel": "crm-evaluation", "user": "marie.tremblay", "message": "Hey team, as we plan for 2026 growth, we need to finalize our CRM requirements. Any thoughts on Canada-specific needs?", "create_at": 1736330400000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "operations", "channel": "crm-evaluation", "user": "david.chen", "message": "Good question. I think there might be some unique requirements since we're Canadian. Something about regulations from maybe 2015 or 2016?", "create_at": 1736330520000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "operations", "channel": "crm-evaluation", "user": "jason.park", "message": "Yeah I've been looking into this. Pretty sure the Canadian government established CRM compliance requirements around January 2016. Could be 2 or 3 main things we need to address.", "create_at": 1736330700000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "operations", "channel": "crm-evaluation", "user": "sarah.mitchell", "message": "From what I remember, legal compliance is definitely one. And I think patient data storage might need to stay within Canadian borders? Not 100% sure on the specifics though.", "create_at": 1736330880000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "operations", "channel": "crm-evaluation", "user": "marie.tremblay", "message": "That makes sense for PIPEDA compliance. What about language requirements? We serve Quebec clients too.", "create_at": 1736331000000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "operations", "channel": "crm-evaluation", "user": "david.chen", "message": "Oh right, I believe the system probably needs to support both French and English. That could be one of the 3 requirements Jason mentioned.", "create_at": 1736331180000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "operations", "channel": "crm-evaluation", "user": "jason.park", "message": "So to summarize what we think: 1) legal compliance attention, 2) Canadian data residency, 3) bilingual support (FR/EN). These might be the key Canadian-specific requirements.", "create_at": 1736331360000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "operations", "channel": "crm-evaluation", "user": "sarah.mitchell", "message": "Should we verify these requirements with compliance? I want to make sure we're not missing anything for our 2026 expansion plans.", "create_at": 1736331540000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "operations", "channel": "crm-evaluation", "user": "marie.tremblay", "message": "Good idea Sarah. I'll reach out to the compliance team to confirm. These seem like the right areas but let's double-check before finalizing vendor criteria.", "create_at": 1736331720000}}

