{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-insights", "channel": "sustainability-research", "user": "melissa.wong", "message": "Hey team, quick question - I'm putting together the quarterly report for leadership. @andrew.chen when exactly did your team kick off the sustainability transparency research?", "create_at": 1718193600000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-insights", "channel": "sustainability-research", "user": "andrew.chen", "message": "Good timing! We initiated research on customer attitudes towards sustainability transparency in September 2023. The focus has been measuring how disclosure of delivery carbon footprints would influence shopping behaviors.", "create_at": 1718193900000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-insights", "channel": "sustainability-research", "user": "david.park", "message": "That's been running for about 9 months now right? I remember the initial surveys going out around that time. Have we seen any significant findings so far?", "create_at": 1718194200000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-insights", "channel": "sustainability-research", "user": "andrew.chen", "message": "Yes, exactly 9 months. Early results are promising - customers in our Vancouver and Seattle markets are showing strong interest in carbon footprint transparency. We're seeing about 34% of respondents say it would affect their delivery choices.", "create_at": 1718194500000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-insights", "channel": "sustainability-research", "user": "jennifer.liu", "message": "That's interesting! Do you think this could tie into our online grocery delivery expansion? Might be a differentiator against H-Mart and mainstream competitors.", "create_at": 1718194800000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-insights", "channel": "sustainability-research", "user": "andrew.chen", "message": "Absolutely. The whole point was to understand if sustainability transparency could become a competitive advantage for Lee's Market. We're preparing recommendations for Q3.", "create_at": 1718195100000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-insights", "channel": "sustainability-research", "user": "melissa.wong", "message": "Perfect, thanks Andrew! I'll note September 2023 as the initiation date. Can you send me the methodology summary for the report?", "create_at": 1718195400000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-insights", "channel": "sustainability-research", "user": "andrew.chen", "message": "Will do - I'll share the full methodology doc by end of day. It covers our survey design, sample sizes across all markets, and the carbon footprint disclosure scenarios we tested.", "create_at": 1718195700000}}

