Best Regards,
Sarah Johnson", "folder": "inbox", "read": true, "attachments": []}
{"type": "email", "id": "email_002", "subject": "Re: Feedback on IT Service Desk Efficiency", "from": "emily.patel@mediconn.ca", "from_name": "Emily Patel", "to": ["sarah.johnson@mediconn.ca", "michael.thomas@mediconn.ca"], "cc": [], "date": "2026-09-15 10:15:00", "body": "Dear Sarah,

