{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-operations", "channel": "itsm-modernization", "user": "derek.chen", "message": "Hey team, I finally got the results back from that internal survey we ran with the service desk staff about the AI-integrated ITSM proposal. Thought you'd want to see the highlights.", "create_at": 1744281600000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-operations", "channel": "itsm-modernization", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "Oh nice! Been waiting on this. What's the general sentiment?", "create_at": 1744281720000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-operations", "channel": "itsm-modernization", "user": "derek.chen", "message": "Pretty positive actually. Around 65% of respondents said they spend too much time answering common questions. The thinking is that AI could handle those routine inquiries instead.", "create_at": 1744281900000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-operations", "channel": "itsm-modernization", "user": "marcus.williams", "message": "That makes sense afaik. Password resets and VPN issues alone probably account for half our tickets lol", "create_at": 1744282080000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-operations", "channel": "itsm-modernization", "user": "sarah.nguyen", "message": "So the idea is that integrating AI might free up the desk staff to focus on more complex issues? That could be a big win for response times on critical tickets.", "create_at": 1744282260000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-operations", "channel": "itsm-modernization", "user": "derek.chen", "message": "Exactly. Last I heard from the vendor demo, their AI can handle about 70% of tier-1 queries automatically. Though that number might be optimistic tbh.", "create_at": 1744282440000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-operations", "channel": "itsm-modernization", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "Still, even if it's closer to 50%, that's a huge improvement. Our team's been stretched thin since we onboarded those new corporate wellness clients.", "create_at": 1744282620000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-operations", "channel": "itsm-modernization", "user": "marcus.williams", "message": "Do we know if there are concerns about job security? Sometimes these AI rollouts can make people nervous.", "create_at": 1744282800000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-operations", "channel": "itsm-modernization", "user": "derek.chen", "message": "Good question. The survey touched on that - most staff seemed okay with it as long as it's positioned as augmentation, not replacement. They want to work on more meaningful problems.", "create_at": 1744282980000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-operations", "channel": "itsm-modernization", "user": "sarah.nguyen", "message": "That aligns with what I've heard too. I think if we communicate it properly, this could actually boost morale. Nobody loves answering 'how do I reset my password' 50 times a day \ud83d\ude05", "create_at": 1744283160000}}

