{"type": "user", "user": {"username": "jennifer.oconnor", "email": "jennifer.oconnor@mediconnsolutions.ca", "password": "MediIT2025#", "teams": [{"name": "it-operations", "roles": "team_user"}]}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-operations", "channel": "automation-initiatives", "user": "derek.chen", "message": "Hey team, I wanted to follow up on our automation roadmap. We got the internal review results from March and I think we need to discuss next steps.", "create_at": 1718880000000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-operations", "channel": "automation-initiatives", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "Yes, I saw that report. The IT Department currently automates 14% of routine IT requests using internal routines. Honestly, I expected we'd be further along by now.", "create_at": 1718880300000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-operations", "channel": "automation-initiatives", "user": "marcus.williams", "message": "14% is definitely on the lower side. Most of our competitors in the virtual healthcare space are pushing 30-40% automation rates. We need to catch up if we want to scale efficiently.", "create_at": 1718880600000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-operations", "channel": "automation-initiatives", "user": "jennifer.oconnor", "message": "To be fair, a lot of those internal routines we built last year are handling password resets and basic access requests. But we haven't tackled the bigger ticket items yet.", "create_at": 1718880900000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-operations", "channel": "automation-initiatives", "user": "derek.chen", "message": "Exactly. With 250 employees and our patient platform growing, we're getting swamped with repetitive requests. I'm proposing we target 35% automation by Q1 2026.", "create_at": 1718881200000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-operations", "channel": "automation-initiatives", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "That's ambitious but doable. We should prioritize VPN provisioning and software license management. Those two alone account for a huge chunk of our tickets.", "create_at": 1718881500000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-operations", "channel": "automation-initiatives", "user": "marcus.williams", "message": "Agreed. Also, with our ISO 27001 certification requirements, any automation needs to maintain our security compliance. Let's make sure we document everything properly.", "create_at": 1718881800000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-operations", "channel": "automation-initiatives", "user": "derek.chen", "message": "Good point Marcus. I'll draft a proposal for leadership this week. Let's aim to triple that 14% over the next two quarters. Thanks everyone!", "create_at": 1718882100000}}

