{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-operations", "channel": "service-desk-improvements", "user": "rachel.chen", "message": "Hey team, just finished reviewing the Q1 2024 Customer Satisfaction survey results. We need to talk about what came up.", "create_at": 1713880800000}}
