{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-operations", "channel": "service-desk-improvements", "user": "rachel.chen", "message": "So the most frequently documented customer complaint about the IT Service Desk is lack of communication regarding ticket status updates. Not super surprising tbh but it's clearly our biggest pain point.", "create_at": 1713881400000}}
