{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "it-operations", "channel": "service-desk-improvements", "user": "rachel.chen", "message": "Exactly what I was thinking. ServiceNow has that capability - we just never configured it properly. @david.kumar can you look into setting up automated status change emails?", "create_at": 1713882300000}}
