{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-success", "channel": "post-visit-feedback", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "Hey team, just got the Q1 2025 poll results back. Wanted to share some key findings from our post-visit inquiry analysis.", "create_at": 1746532800000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-success", "channel": "post-visit-feedback", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "Perfect timing! I've been waiting on those. What's the breakdown looking like?", "create_at": 1746533100000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-success", "channel": "post-visit-feedback", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "So afaik, billing confusion is still our biggest pain point. About 28% of post-visit inquiries are patients confused about why their charges differ from expectations - specifically the gap between corporate wellness plan coverage and provincial health insurance.", "create_at": 1746533400000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-success", "channel": "post-visit-feedback", "user": "jessica.okonkwo", "message": "That tracks with what I've been hearing on calls. Patients think their employer plan covers everything, then get surprised when provincial coverage kicks in differently.", "create_at": 1746533700000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-success", "channel": "post-visit-feedback", "user": "daniel.tremblay", "message": "Last I heard, leadership wants us to tackle this aggressively. What's the target reduction we're aiming for?", "create_at": 1746534000000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-success", "channel": "post-visit-feedback", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "The department is looking to reduce these billing confusion inquiries by 75% by 2027. Ambitious but might be doable if we improve our pre-visit cost transparency.", "create_at": 1746534300000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-success", "channel": "post-visit-feedback", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "That's a significant target. Could be challenging but I think better communication during booking could help. Maybe a cost estimate popup?", "create_at": 1746534600000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-success", "channel": "post-visit-feedback", "user": "jessica.okonkwo", "message": "I like that idea. We should also consider sending clearer post-visit billing summaries that explain the corporate vs provincial split.", "create_at": 1746534900000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-success", "channel": "post-visit-feedback", "user": "daniel.tremblay", "message": "Good points all around. Let's draft some proposals for the next CS leadership meeting.", "create_at": 1746535200000}}

