{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "product", "channel": "ux-research", "user": "maya.chen", "message": "Hey team! Just finished analyzing the Q1 2024 heat map data for our booking platform. Got some interesting findings to share.", "create_at": 1720012800000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "product", "channel": "ux-research", "user": "david.kumar", "message": "Perfect timing @maya.chen - we're prepping the roadmap review. What are you seeing?", "create_at": 1720013100000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "product", "channel": "ux-research", "user": "maya.chen", "message": "So the big one: **29% of users are clicking the Help or Contact Support button during the booking process**. That's way higher than we expected.", "create_at": 1720013400000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "product", "channel": "ux-research", "user": "sarah.tremblay", "message": "Whoa, nearly a third of users need help mid-booking? That's a red flag for the interface design \ud83d\ude2c", "create_at": 1720013700000}}
