{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-support", "channel": "billing-inquiries", "user": "rachel.nguyen", "message": "Hey team, got a question from a patient in Toronto asking why their bill is lower than their cousin's in Vancouver. Anyone have the latest on provincial billing differences?", "create_at": 1736089200000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-support", "channel": "billing-inquiries", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "Yeah, I can help with that! So afaik, Ontario patients can access provincial telehealth billing codes now. Pretty sure it reduces their out-of-pocket costs by around 35%. BC patients still pay standard rates though.", "create_at": 1736089500000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-support", "channel": "billing-inquiries", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "That's correct from what I heard from the billing department last week. They confirmed Ontario's codes went live and we should see this continue moving into 2027.", "create_at": 1736089800000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-support", "channel": "billing-inquiries", "user": "rachel.nguyen", "message": "Perfect, thanks! Also the patient asked about follow-up care recommendations. Can we advise on that?", "create_at": 1736090100000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-support", "channel": "billing-inquiries", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "Nope, we definitely can't provide any medical advice on follow-up care - provincial regs are strict on that. But we CAN explain admin stuff like how to book referrals, next steps for appointments, etc.", "create_at": 1736090400000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-support", "channel": "billing-inquiries", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "I think so too. Last I heard from compliance, we stick to administrative guidance only. Medical questions need to go back to the healthcare provider.", "create_at": 1736090700000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-support", "channel": "billing-inquiries", "user": "rachel.nguyen", "message": "Got it! So I'll let them know about the Ontario billing codes and offer to walk them through booking their referral. Thanks everyone! \ud83d\ude4f", "create_at": 1736091000000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-support", "channel": "billing-inquiries", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "Sounds good! Maybe we should put together a quick reference doc for the team on provincial differences. I'll sync with billing to get the latest numbers.", "create_at": 1736091300000}}

