{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-experience", "channel": "appointment-systems", "user": "rachel.chen", "message": "Hey team, just got off a call with a frustrated patient. She didn't realize she had to manually book her next mental health counselling session. This keeps coming up.", "create_at": 1704646800000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-experience", "channel": "appointment-systems", "user": "david.morrison", "message": "Yeah, this is a known issue. Mental health sessions involve recurring appointments that patients book in series\u2014weekly or bi-weekly\u2014but they have to do it themselves each time. GP consultations are different; they're one-time unless the physician recommends a follow-up.", "create_at": 1704647100000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-experience", "channel": "appointment-systems", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "Remember that customer service survey from November 2023? It showed 68% of patients didn't understand they needed to manually book subsequent mental health sessions. That's why our call volume spiked.", "create_at": 1704647400000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-experience", "channel": "appointment-systems", "user": "marcus.bell", "message": "That's a huge percentage. Are the executives doing anything about this?", "create_at": 1704647700000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-experience", "channel": "appointment-systems", "user": "david.morrison", "message": "Good news on that front. The executives are aware and have plans to address these differences by Q3 2024. They're looking at automating the recurring booking flow for mental health patients.", "create_at": 1704648000000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-experience", "channel": "appointment-systems", "user": "rachel.chen", "message": "That would be amazing. Right now I'm spending half my day explaining this to confused patients. Any timeline on specifics?", "create_at": 1704648300000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-experience", "channel": "appointment-systems", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "I heard product is scoping it now. Should have more details by end of Q1. For now, let's make sure our scripts clearly explain the manual booking requirement.", "create_at": 1704648600000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-experience", "channel": "appointment-systems", "user": "marcus.bell", "message": "Agreed. I'll draft an updated FAQ section for the knowledge base today. We need to reduce these support calls until the fix is live.", "create_at": 1704648900000}}

