{"type": "user", "user": {"username": "david.okonkwo", "email": "david.okonkwo@mediconnsolutions.ca", "password": "Do!wellness88", "teams": [{"name": "corporate-services", "roles": "team_user"}]}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "corporate-services", "channel": "billing-operations", "user": "marcus.williams", "message": "Hey team, quick heads up - I just got the results from the Q2 audit of employee patient call records. We have a problem.", "create_at": 1720785600000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "corporate-services", "channel": "billing-operations", "user": "rachel.chen", "message": "What kind of problem? The billing side has been pretty smooth with the pre-negotiated rates and direct employer charges.", "create_at": 1720785900000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "corporate-services", "channel": "billing-operations", "user": "marcus.williams", "message": "So our corporate program participants get simplified billing - either charged directly to employer or subsidized, right? Well, 48% of employees don't understand their specific coverage limits.", "create_at": 1720786200000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "corporate-services", "channel": "billing-operations", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "Wait, almost half? What exactly are they confused about?", "create_at": 1720786500000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "corporate-services", "channel": "billing-operations", "user": "marcus.williams", "message": "Things like their 3 sessions per year limit, or which services need co-pays versus full employer coverage. They just don't know what's included in their plan.", "create_at": 1720786800000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "corporate-services", "channel": "billing-operations", "user": "david.okonkwo", "message": "That tracks with what I've been hearing from support. Lots of surprised employees when they hit their session limits.", "create_at": 1720787100000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "corporate-services", "channel": "billing-operations", "user": "rachel.chen", "message": "So the billing mechanics work fine, but our follow-up communications are failing employees. They need clearer info upfront about their benefits.", "create_at": 1720787400000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "corporate-services", "channel": "billing-operations", "user": "marcus.williams", "message": "Exactly. Leadership is putting together a communications improvement initiative. Currently under review but should help address this confusion going forward.", "create_at": 1720787700000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "corporate-services", "channel": "billing-operations", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "Good call. Maybe benefit summaries after each session showing remaining coverage? Would help a lot.", "create_at": 1720788000000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "corporate-services", "channel": "billing-operations", "user": "david.okonkwo", "message": "I'll flag this for the product team too. Could be a platform enhancement opportunity.", "create_at": 1720788300000}}

