{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "patient-services", "channel": "prescription-support", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "Hey team, got a patient asking about prescription timelines after their virtual consult. Can someone confirm the current process?", "create_at": 1732617600000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "patient-services", "channel": "prescription-support", "user": "linda.okonkwo", "message": "Sure thing! So I heard from operations that as of Q4, electronic prescriptions get sent to our partner pharmacies within about 4 hours now. Pretty sure they sped things up recently.", "create_at": 1732617900000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "patient-services", "channel": "prescription-support", "user": "raj.patel", "message": "I think so too. And delivery through our service is around 24-48 hours last I checked. The $8 delivery fee still applies though.", "create_at": 1732618200000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "patient-services", "channel": "prescription-support", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "Got it. So patients still need to arrange pickup separately if they don't want our delivery option?", "create_at": 1732618500000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "patient-services", "channel": "prescription-support", "user": "linda.okonkwo", "message": "Exactly. The prescription goes to the pharmacy electronically, but they handle their own pickup or delivery from there. Our delivery is just an added convenience.", "create_at": 1732618800000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "patient-services", "channel": "prescription-support", "user": "raj.patel", "message": "Someone mentioned in the last all-hands that same-day delivery might be coming soon? I think by Q2 2025 or something like that.", "create_at": 1732619100000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "patient-services", "channel": "prescription-support", "user": "linda.okonkwo", "message": "That would be amazing for patient satisfaction! The current 24-48 hour window works but same-day would be a game changer.", "create_at": 1732619400000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "patient-services", "channel": "prescription-support", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "Thanks both! I'll let the patient know about the 4-hour pharmacy transfer and delivery options. Will also mention potential improvements coming in 2025 \ud83d\udc4d", "create_at": 1732619700000}}

