{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-experience", "channel": "patient-satisfaction", "user": "rachel.chen", "message": "Hi team, just finished compiling the results from our September patient questionnaire. We need to discuss the billing confusion issue.", "create_at": 1701180000000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-experience", "channel": "patient-satisfaction", "user": "david.kumar", "message": "What are we seeing? I've noticed more calls about post-visit billing questions lately.", "create_at": 1701180300000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-experience", "channel": "patient-satisfaction", "user": "rachel.chen", "message": "The data is pretty clear. So far in Q3 2023, patients who contacted support and were confused about billing rated their experience **2.9/5** on average. Compare that to **4.3/5** for patients who didn't need post-visit clarification.", "create_at": 1701180600000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-experience", "channel": "patient-satisfaction", "user": "michelle.tremblay", "message": "That's a 1.4 point gap! No wonder our overall scores have been dipping.", "create_at": 1701180900000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-experience", "channel": "patient-satisfaction", "user": "james.wright", "message": "This is concerning. Are we seeing any improvement from the billing explanation scripts we rolled out?", "create_at": 1701181200000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-experience", "channel": "patient-satisfaction", "user": "rachel.chen", "message": "Yes! When agents provide clear billing explanations during support calls, scores jump to **3.8/5**. That's significant improvement.", "create_at": 1701181500000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-experience", "channel": "patient-satisfaction", "user": "david.kumar", "message": "So the solution is proactive communication. We should ensure every support interaction includes a billing summary, even if the patient doesn't ask.", "create_at": 1701181800000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-experience", "channel": "patient-satisfaction", "user": "james.wright", "message": "Agreed. Let's also look at automating billing summaries post-consultation. @michelle.tremblay can you work with the product team on that?", "create_at": 1701182100000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-experience", "channel": "patient-satisfaction", "user": "michelle.tremblay", "message": "Absolutely. I'll set up a meeting this week. These numbers make a strong business case for the feature.", "create_at": 1701182400000}}

