{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-success", "channel": "support-insights", "user": "jessica.wong", "message": "Hey team, I've been reviewing the Q4 2024 support ticket data and noticed something interesting. We had a significant portion of patients reaching out about referrals and lab work.", "create_at": 1741351200000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-success", "channel": "support-insights", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "Oh yeah, I remember that period. What were the main concerns?", "create_at": 1741351500000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-success", "channel": "support-insights", "user": "jessica.wong", "message": "So basically, when a virtual doctor recommended a patient see a specialist or get lab work done, there was a lot of confusion. Doctors could provide referral recommendations and requisitions through the platform, but patients had to independently book with external specialists and labs themselves.", "create_at": 1741351800000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-success", "channel": "support-insights", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "That makes sense. I think around 47% of patients contacting support were confused about whether MediConn coordinated these appointments or if they had to do it themselves, afaik.", "create_at": 1741352100000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-success", "channel": "support-insights", "user": "david.martinez", "message": "47%? That's almost half our support volume on this one issue. Were patients expecting us to handle the booking?", "create_at": 1741352400000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-success", "channel": "support-insights", "user": "jessica.wong", "message": "Exactly. Many thought we'd coordinate everything end-to-end. The messaging on the platform might not have been clear enough that they needed to take the next step independently.", "create_at": 1741352700000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-success", "channel": "support-insights", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "Last I heard, product was looking into this for a future update. Could be worth flagging again with the UX team to improve in-app guidance.", "create_at": 1741353000000}}
