{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "product", "channel": "user-analytics", "user": "david.chen", "message": "Hey team, just finished reviewing the Q3 booking funnel data. We need to discuss some concerning trends I'm seeing.", "create_at": 1697385600000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "product", "channel": "user-analytics", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "What did you find? Is it the payment step again?", "create_at": 1697385720000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "product", "channel": "user-analytics", "user": "david.chen", "message": "Actually no - the biggest drop-off is at the coverage verification step. Here's the breakdown:\n\n| Step | Abandonment Rate | Users Affected |\n|------|-----------------|----------------|\n| Provider Selection | 3% | ~1,200 |\n| Coverage Verification | **9%** | **3,800** |\n| Payment | 4% | ~1,600 |\n| Final Confirmation | 2% | ~850 |", "create_at": 1697385900000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "product", "channel": "user-analytics", "user": "michelle.watts", "message": "3,800 users abandoning at coverage verification? That's significant. Are these users contacting support about issues?", "create_at": 1697386020000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "product", "channel": "user-analytics", "user": "david.chen", "message": "That's the concerning part - they're NOT contacting support. These 3,800 users abandoned during provincial health card and supplemental insurance validation without ever reaching out or completing their booking.", "create_at": 1697386200000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "product", "channel": "user-analytics", "user": "james.liu", "message": "Silent abandonment is the worst. They're hitting a wall with insurance validation and just leaving. Could be confusing UI or unclear error messages.", "create_at": 1697386380000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "product", "channel": "user-analytics", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "Agreed. We should add better inline guidance for the health card entry and maybe a live chat prompt when users stall at that step.", "create_at": 1697386500000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "product", "channel": "user-analytics", "user": "michelle.watts", "message": "I'll draft a UX improvement proposal. 9% of total booking attempts is too high to ignore. @david.chen can you share the full report?", "create_at": 1697386620000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "product", "channel": "user-analytics", "user": "david.chen", "message": "Absolutely, sending it now. Let's prioritize this for Q4 planning.", "create_at": 1697386740000}}

