{"type": "email", "id": "email_001", "subject": "Improving Patient Access to Virtual Services", "from": "rachel.lee@mediconn.com", "from_name": "Rachel Lee", "to": ["michael.johnson@mediconn.com", "lisa.campbell@mediconn.com", "peter.murphy@mediconn.com", "sarah.brown@mediconn.com", "james.miller@mediconn.com", "karen.davis@mediconn.com", "david.martin@mediconn.com"], "cc": [], "date": "2026-01-05 09:30:00", "body": "Dear team,

I hope this email finds you well. As we dive into Q1 2026, one of our core objectives is to enhance patient access to our virtual consultations and prescription management services. The goal is to provide a seamless, satisfactory experience, reduce wait times, and improve patient retention.

