{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "patient-experience", "channel": "retention-metrics", "user": "rachel.chen", "message": "Hey team, I just finished compiling the 2023 retention report. We need to discuss some concerning findings before our Q1 planning meeting.", "create_at": 1704816000000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "patient-experience", "channel": "retention-metrics", "user": "marcus.williams", "message": "Sure, what are we looking at?", "create_at": 1704816300000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "patient-experience", "channel": "retention-metrics", "user": "rachel.chen", "message": "MediConn's patient retention rate for returning users actually improved from 68% in 2022 to 71% in 2023. However, we're still losing nearly 30% of patients.", "create_at": 1704816600000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "patient-experience", "channel": "retention-metrics", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "That's a modest improvement, but I agree we need to dig deeper. Do we have data on why patients aren't coming back?", "create_at": 1704816900000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "patient-experience", "channel": "retention-metrics", "user": "rachel.chen", "message": "Yes! Exit surveys conducted throughout 2023 revealed that **42% of patients who didn't return cited the inconvenient booking process** as their primary reason. Another **25% mentioned long wait times** for appointments.", "create_at": 1704817200000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "patient-experience", "channel": "retention-metrics", "user": "david.nguyen", "message": "That's significant. The booking process issue aligns with feedback we've been getting. Our current system requires too many clicks to schedule a consultation.", "create_at": 1704817500000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "patient-experience", "channel": "retention-metrics", "user": "marcus.williams", "message": "So we're looking at 67% of churned patients leaving due to UX and capacity issues. That's actionable.", "create_at": 1704817800000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "patient-experience", "channel": "retention-metrics", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "Agreed. @david.nguyen can product prioritize a booking flow redesign this quarter?", "create_at": 1704818100000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "patient-experience", "channel": "retention-metrics", "user": "david.nguyen", "message": "Already flagging it for the roadmap. We should target 75%+ retention by end of 2024 if we address these issues.", "create_at": 1704818400000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "patient-experience", "channel": "retention-metrics", "user": "rachel.chen", "message": "Perfect. Let's present this to leadership next week with concrete recommendations. I'll prepare the deck.", "create_at": 1704818700000}}

