{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "product", "channel": "ux-research", "user": "david.wong", "message": "That sounds about right from what I remember. I think the UX tracking showed something like 45% of new users needed help from customer support during registration? Could be off on that number though.", "create_at": 1710591000000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "product", "channel": "ux-research", "user": "emma.taylor", "message": "As someone from support, that 45% figure feels high but plausible. We definitely get a lot of registration questions. The verification steps confuse people.", "create_at": 1710591300000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "product", "channel": "ux-research", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "12 minutes is concerning if accurate. Do we have satisfaction data comparing users who needed support vs those who didn't?", "create_at": 1710591600000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "product", "channel": "ux-research", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "I think so. From what I heard, patients who needed support intervention rated booking around 3.2 out of 5, while independent completions were closer to 4.3. Pretty significant gap.", "create_at": 1710591900000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "product", "channel": "ux-research", "user": "david.wong", "message": "That gap is definitely something we need to address. We should prioritize streamlining the PIPEDA consent flow and health card verification steps.", "create_at": 1710592200000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "product", "channel": "ux-research", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "Agreed. Let's pull the official reports to confirm these numbers before the roadmap meeting. Can someone loop in analytics to get verified data?", "create_at": 1710592500000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "product", "channel": "ux-research", "user": "emma.taylor", "message": "I'll reach out to the data team. We should have concrete figures by tomorrow.", "create_at": 1710592800000}}

