{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "client-success", "channel": "retention-strategies", "user": "emily.nguyen", "message": "Agreed! The SME clients especially seem to appreciate having a dedicated point of contact. Long-term engagement has definitely improved from what I've seen.", "create_at": 1735043400000}}

