{"type": "user", "user": {"username": "rachel.chen", "email": "rachel.chen@mediconn.ca", "password": "Str@tegy2024!", "teams": [{"name": "strategy", "roles": "team_admin"}]}}
{"type": "user", "user": {"username": "derek.morrison", "email": "derek.morrison@mediconn.ca", "password": "Growth#2024", "teams": [{"name": "strategy", "roles": "team_user"}]}}
{"type": "user", "user": {"username": "priya.sharma", "email": "priya.sharma@mediconn.ca", "password": "Ops$Secure99", "teams": [{"name": "strategy", "roles": "team_user"}]}}
{"type": "user", "user": {"username": "marcus.bell", "email": "marcus.bell@mediconn.ca", "password": "Sales!2024Mc", "teams": [{"name": "strategy", "roles": "team_user"}]}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "strategy", "channel": "2026-expansion", "user": "rachel.chen", "message": "Hey team, wanted to get everyone's thoughts on the challenges we're facing as we push into 2026. What's everyone seeing out there?", "create_at": 1714060800000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "strategy", "channel": "2026-expansion", "user": "marcus.bell", "message": "From the sales side, afaik our B2C cycle is pretty short which sounds good but it means we have less time to build relationships. Decisions happen fast with usually just one person deciding.", "create_at": 1714061100000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "strategy", "channel": "2026-expansion", "user": "derek.morrison", "message": "That tracks with what I've been hearing. Single-stakeholder decision-making is common in our space. Last I heard, that's been the pattern since like 2024-25ish.", "create_at": 1714061400000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "strategy", "channel": "2026-expansion", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "On the ops side, I think regulatory requirements are pretty minimal right now? At least compared to what we expected. But service quality objections keep coming up frequently in feedback.", "create_at": 1714061700000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "strategy", "channel": "2026-expansion", "user": "rachel.chen", "message": "Service quality concerns are definitely something we need to address. What about integration challenges?", "create_at": 1714062000000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "strategy", "channel": "2026-expansion", "user": "marcus.bell", "message": "Oh yeah, solution integration for small practices is a big one. Many of them have legacy systems and getting our platform to work smoothly has been... not ideal. Been a trend we've noticed over the past year or so.", "create_at": 1714062300000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "strategy", "channel": "2026-expansion", "user": "derek.morrison", "message": "So to summarize the major challenges for April 2026: short B2C sales cycles, single-stakeholder decisions, minimal regs (surprisingly), quality objections, and integration headaches for smaller clinics.", "create_at": 1714062600000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "strategy", "channel": "2026-expansion", "user": "rachel.chen", "message": "Good summary Derek. Let's schedule a deep-dive on each of these next week. I'll send calendar invites.", "create_at": 1714062900000}}

