{"type": "user", "user": {"username": "elena.kowalski", "email": "elena.kowalski@mediconn.ca", "password": "SecurePass321!", "teams": [{"name": "strategy", "roles": "team_user"}]}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "strategy", "channel": "2026-expansion", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "Hey team, wanted to kick off our discussion about challenges we're facing as we push into 2026. I've been reviewing our Q4 reports and there's a lot to unpack.", "create_at": 1735840800000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "strategy", "channel": "2026-expansion", "user": "jason.nguyen", "message": "Good timing. I was just looking at our B2C pipeline. The sales cycle is pretty short which sounds good, but it means we're dealing with single decision-makers mostly. Less room for enterprise-level negotiations.", "create_at": 1735841100000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "strategy", "channel": "2026-expansion", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "I think the regulatory side might be less of an issue than we expected? From what I've seen in the 2024-25 trend data, requirements have been minimal compared to what we prepared for.", "create_at": 1735841400000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "strategy", "channel": "2026-expansion", "user": "elena.kowalski", "message": "That's interesting Marcus. But honestly the bigger headache seems to be data privacy objections. We're getting pushback frequently from potential clients. They're nervous about patient data even with our PIPEDA compliance.", "create_at": 1735841700000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "strategy", "channel": "2026-expansion", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "Yeah that tracks with what sales has been reporting. The objections over data privacy come up in like almost every call now. We might need better messaging around our ISO 27001 certification.", "create_at": 1735842000000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "strategy", "channel": "2026-expansion", "user": "jason.nguyen", "message": "Also - and this could be a big one - platform scalability for small healthcare practices is a real challenge. Our infrastructure wasn't originally built for tons of small clinics onboarding simultaneously.", "create_at": 1735842300000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "strategy", "channel": "2026-expansion", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "Pretty sure that's been an ongoing issue since late 2024. The engineering team mentioned they're working on it but it's not a quick fix.", "create_at": 1735842600000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "strategy", "channel": "2026-expansion", "user": "elena.kowalski", "message": "So to summarize for March planning: short B2C cycles, single decision-makers, minimal reg requirements, privacy objections, and scalability issues. That about cover it?", "create_at": 1735842900000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "strategy", "channel": "2026-expansion", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "I think so! Let's schedule a deeper dive next week. Good discussion everyone \ud83d\udc4d", "create_at": 1735843200000}}

