{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-success", "channel": "crm-systems", "user": "emily.lee", "message": "Hey team, I've been putting together my findings on our current CRM situation and it's honestly a mess. We've got customer data fragmented across approximately 12 separate platforms right now.", "create_at": 1740750000000}}
