{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-success", "channel": "crm-systems", "user": "jake.morrison", "message": "This explains so much. When customers call about home charging station issues, I can't see their original purchase history or what the sales team promised them. We're flying blind.", "create_at": 1740750900000}}
