{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-success", "channel": "retention-strategies", "user": "jennifer.watts", "message": "Hey team, I wanted to share some early findings from our Q4 retention analysis. The numbers around proactive vs reactive support are pretty interesting.", "create_at": 1734012000000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-success", "channel": "retention-strategies", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "Oh nice! I've been curious about this. We've been pushing those maintenance reminders for vehicles and home charging stations pretty hard lately.", "create_at": 1734012180000}}
