{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "dealer-operations", "channel": "partner-relations", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "Team, wanted to check in on the dealer dispute resolution times. We've been getting some pushback from leadership about turnaround.", "create_at": 1710244800000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "dealer-operations", "channel": "partner-relations", "user": "emily.lee", "message": "I've been digging into this actually. From what I can tell, we're averaging around 2 weeks to fully resolve dealer disputes or performance issues. Could be slightly less in some regions but that's the ballpark.", "create_at": 1710245100000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "dealer-operations", "channel": "partner-relations", "user": "diana.ross", "message": "Two weeks seems long. What's causing the delays?", "create_at": 1710245400000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "dealer-operations", "channel": "partner-relations", "user": "emily.lee", "message": "Honestly, it might be a few things. The documentation is pretty fragmented across our dealer network - different formats, missing info, etc. Plus afaik we don't have standardized performance contracts across all dealers which makes things messy.", "create_at": 1710245700000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "dealer-operations", "channel": "partner-relations", "user": "kevin.wright", "message": "That tracks with what I've seen on the legal side. Last I heard, some of our Southwest dealers are still on legacy agreements from 2019. Makes it hard to enforce consistent standards.", "create_at": 1710246000000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "dealer-operations", "channel": "partner-relations", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "This is concerning. We're expanding the dealer network for the new EV line launch and can't afford these bottlenecks.", "create_at": 1710246300000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "dealer-operations", "channel": "partner-relations", "user": "emily.lee", "message": "Agreed. I think we need to push for contract standardization and maybe a centralized documentation system. I can put together a proposal if that helps?", "create_at": 1710246600000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "dealer-operations", "channel": "partner-relations", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "Please do. Let's target getting resolution times down to under a week if possible. Loop in legal too.", "create_at": 1710246900000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "dealer-operations", "channel": "partner-relations", "user": "kevin.wright", "message": "Happy to help draft standardized contract templates. Should probably align with our CARB compliance requirements too while we're at it.", "create_at": 1710247200000}}

