{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "dealer-operations", "channel": "network-performance", "user": "david.martinez", "message": "What's causing most of the delays? Is it the new contract terms or system adoption issues?", "create_at": 1718889600000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "dealer-operations", "channel": "network-performance", "user": "emily.lee", "message": "Mix of both tbh. Some dealers are still getting used to the standardized contracts and there's a learning curve with the new centralized system. But at least everyone's on the same page now with consistent processes.", "create_at": 1718889900000}}
