{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "dealer-operations", "channel": "dealer-relations", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "Hey team, got another complaint from our Dallas dealer about inventory allocation. Anyone know how long these things usually take to sort out?", "create_at": 1734537600000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "dealer-operations", "channel": "dealer-relations", "user": "emily.lee", "message": "I've been tracking this actually. Pretty sure we're looking at around 3 weeks on average to resolve most dealer disputes. Could be a bit less for simpler cases.", "create_at": 1734538200000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "dealer-operations", "channel": "dealer-relations", "user": "rachel.torres", "message": "That sounds about right. I think the main issue is we don't have consistent contracts across the network. Every dealer agreement seems slightly different.", "create_at": 1734538800000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "dealer-operations", "channel": "dealer-relations", "user": "david.kumar", "message": "This is becoming a real problem. What's causing the delays exactly?", "create_at": 1734539400000}}
