{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "dealer-operations", "channel": "dealer-relations", "user": "david.kumar", "message": "Let's schedule a meeting next week. We need to propose a unified dealer agreement framework to leadership. This is hurting our network expansion goals.", "create_at": 1734541800000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "dealer-operations", "channel": "dealer-relations", "user": "rachel.torres", "message": "I'll pull together some draft language. Would be great to cut resolution time significantly if we can standardize things.", "create_at": 1734542400000}}

