{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "dealer-operations", "channel": "dealer-relations", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "Team, I need an update on our dealer dispute resolution metrics. Leadership is asking about our current turnaround times.", "create_at": 1713436800000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "dealer-operations", "channel": "dealer-relations", "user": "emily.lee", "message": "Hi Marcus! I just finished compiling the March analysis. Our average resolution time for dealer disputes or performance issues is sitting at **4 weeks**. This is with the new centralized dealer management system we rolled out in early 2025.", "create_at": 1713437400000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "dealer-operations", "channel": "dealer-relations", "user": "rachel.torres", "message": "4 weeks seems reasonable given the complexity. Are the standardized performance contracts helping streamline things?", "create_at": 1713438000000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "dealer-operations", "channel": "dealer-relations", "user": "emily.lee", "message": "Definitely. The standardized contracts across our dealer network have made expectations clearer. Before Q1, we were dealing with inconsistent terms that caused confusion. Now everyone's on the same page.", "create_at": 1713438600000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "dealer-operations", "channel": "dealer-relations", "user": "david.kim", "message": "What's causing the 4-week timeline? Is it system-related or process?", "create_at": 1713439200000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "dealer-operations", "channel": "dealer-relations", "user": "emily.lee", "message": "Mix of both. The centralized system requires multi-level approvals for dispute escalations. Plus, some dealers in Texas and California have more complex regional compliance requirements that add review time.", "create_at": 1713439800000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "dealer-operations", "channel": "dealer-relations", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "Makes sense. For our EV lineup expansion, we need reliable dealer partnerships. Can you share the full report in our Monday sync?", "create_at": 1713440400000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "dealer-operations", "channel": "dealer-relations", "user": "emily.lee", "message": "Absolutely! I'll prepare a detailed breakdown including case types and resolution bottlenecks. The new system gives us much better visibility now.", "create_at": 1713441000000}}

