{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "dealer-operations", "channel": "performance-reviews", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "Hey team, quick question - when's the next dealer performance review cycle kicking off? I've got some dealerships in the Southwest asking about timelines.", "create_at": 1710244800000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "dealer-operations", "channel": "performance-reviews", "user": "emily.lee", "message": "We're on a semi-annual schedule, so next one starts in April. But honestly, I'm a bit concerned about the data quality heading into it.", "create_at": 1710245100000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "dealer-operations", "channel": "performance-reviews", "user": "sarah.williams", "message": "Data quality issues again? What's going on?", "create_at": 1710245400000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "dealer-operations", "channel": "performance-reviews", "user": "emily.lee", "message": "Yeah, I ran the numbers yesterday. About 28% of our performance metrics are either incomplete or submitted late. It's really frustrating because we can't get accurate comparisons across regions.", "create_at": 1710245700000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "dealer-operations", "channel": "performance-reviews", "user": "david.patel", "message": "28%? That's pretty significant. What's causing it?", "create_at": 1710246000000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "dealer-operations", "channel": "performance-reviews", "user": "emily.lee", "message": "Inconsistent reporting standards across dealership regions mostly. Some use our standard templates, others have their own systems. Plus the timing expectations vary - Texas dealers submit weekly, but some Canadian partners only do monthly.", "create_at": 1710246300000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "dealer-operations", "channel": "performance-reviews", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "That explains why comparing EV sales performance between regions has been such a headache. Should we push for standardization before the April review?", "create_at": 1710246600000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "dealer-operations", "channel": "performance-reviews", "user": "sarah.williams", "message": "Agreed. Maybe we need a unified dashboard that all dealers have to use?", "create_at": 1710246900000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "dealer-operations", "channel": "performance-reviews", "user": "emily.lee", "message": "That's exactly what I'm proposing in my Q2 roadmap. Let me share the deck tomorrow. We need to fix this before it impacts our ZEV compliance reporting too.", "create_at": 1710247200000}}

