{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "dealer-network", "channel": "performance-reviews", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "Hey team, quick question - how often are we running dealer performance reviews now? Got a new regional manager asking about the cadence.", "create_at": 1724940000000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "dealer-network", "channel": "performance-reviews", "user": "emily.lee", "message": "We do them monthly afaik. Been that way since Q2 at least. The challenge is we're still relying on self-reported data from the dealerships themselves.", "create_at": 1724940300000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "dealer-network", "channel": "performance-reviews", "user": "rachel.torres", "message": "Monthly makes sense for our network size. But yeah the self-review approach has issues. Are we seeing problems with submissions?", "create_at": 1724940600000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "dealer-network", "channel": "performance-reviews", "user": "emily.lee", "message": "Pretty sure it's around 19% of performance metrics that come in incomplete or late each cycle. I ran the numbers last week. It's been a recurring headache for accurate evaluations.", "create_at": 1724940900000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "dealer-network", "channel": "performance-reviews", "user": "david.kim", "message": "That's a significant chunk. Does that affect how we rank dealers in Texas and California regions specifically?", "create_at": 1724941200000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "dealer-network", "channel": "performance-reviews", "user": "emily.lee", "message": "It does, unfortunately. When dealers submit partial data or miss deadlines, we have to work with what we have. I think some dealerships just don't prioritize the reporting.", "create_at": 1724941500000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "dealer-network", "channel": "performance-reviews", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "Last I heard there was talk about integrating DMS data directly instead of manual submissions. Any movement on that?", "create_at": 1724941800000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "dealer-network", "channel": "performance-reviews", "user": "rachel.torres", "message": "IT is scoping it but probably Q1 2027 at earliest. For now we're stuck with the current self-review system and its data quality gaps.", "create_at": 1724942100000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "dealer-network", "channel": "performance-reviews", "user": "emily.lee", "message": "Exactly. Monthly reviews are good in theory but that 19% missing data really undermines the whole process. We need better compliance from the network.", "create_at": 1724942400000}}

