{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "sales-ops", "channel": "dealership-metrics", "user": "rachel.torres", "message": "Hey team, I pulled the Q1 conversion report for 2024 test drives. We need to discuss these numbers before the leadership sync.", "create_at": 1714220400000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "sales-ops", "channel": "dealership-metrics", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "Sure, what are we looking at? I heard there might be some concerns about post-test-drive follow-through.", "create_at": 1714220520000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "sales-ops", "channel": "dealership-metrics", "user": "rachel.torres", "message": "So from what I can tell, around 47% of customers who completed dealership test drives in 2024 proceeded to purchase within 60 days. Could be slightly off but that's the ballpark.", "create_at": 1714220700000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "sales-ops", "channel": "dealership-metrics", "user": "david.nguyen", "message": "Wait, only 47%? That seems like a pretty significant drop-off after initial contact with customers. I thought we were closer to 55% last year?", "create_at": 1714220880000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "sales-ops", "channel": "dealership-metrics", "user": "jennifer.walsh", "message": "Yeah that might be an issue. The EX-4 launch had great test drive numbers but conversion didn't follow. Maybe pricing concerns?", "create_at": 1714221000000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "sales-ops", "channel": "dealership-metrics", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "Could be the financing options too. I've been hearing from Austin dealerships that customers love the vehicles but get cold feet on monthly payments.", "create_at": 1714221180000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "sales-ops", "channel": "dealership-metrics", "user": "rachel.torres", "message": "Good points. The 60-day window might also be too narrow for EV purchases - people do more research. But leadership will want answers on why we're losing over half after test drives.", "create_at": 1714221360000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "sales-ops", "channel": "dealership-metrics", "user": "david.nguyen", "message": "Should we propose extending follow-up touchpoints? Maybe the dealership teams need better nurturing protocols.", "create_at": 1714221540000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "sales-ops", "channel": "dealership-metrics", "user": "jennifer.walsh", "message": "Agreed. I'll draft some recommendations. Let's sync tomorrow morning before the exec call.", "create_at": 1714221720000}}

