{"type": "user", "user": {"username": "kevin.patel", "email": "kevin.patel@elexion-auto.com", "password": "Kev1nP@tel!", "teams": [{"name": "customer-insights", "roles": "team_user"}]}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-insights", "channel": "ev-buyer-research", "user": "diana.ross", "message": "Hey team, just got a request from leadership about home charging station attachment rates. Anyone have data on this?", "create_at": 1714470000000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-insights", "channel": "ev-buyer-research", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "I think we might have something from that June 2027 customer insight report. Let me dig through it.", "create_at": 1714470300000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-insights", "channel": "ev-buyer-research", "user": "kevin.patel", "message": "They specifically want Jan 2023 to Dec 2023 data for both first-hand and second-hand buyers, right?", "create_at": 1714470600000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-insights", "channel": "ev-buyer-research", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "Found something - according to the June 2027 report, it looks like around 25% of firsthand Elexion buyers purchased home charging stations. Though I should note this could be for the July 2027 to December 2027 period, not the 2023 timeframe they're asking about.", "create_at": 1714471200000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-insights", "channel": "ev-buyer-research", "user": "diana.ross", "message": "What about second-hand buyers? That's a growing segment for us.", "create_at": 1714471500000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-insights", "channel": "ev-buyer-research", "user": "kevin.patel", "message": "That's where it gets tricky. From what I recall, we can't really offer the same tracking for second-hand buyers since we lose contact with them after the vehicle changes hands. No reliable data there unfortunately.", "create_at": 1714471800000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-insights", "channel": "ev-buyer-research", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "Yeah, the report confirms that - company lost contact with second-hand buyers so there's no comparable percentage available. Might be worth flagging this as a gap in our customer retention strategy.", "create_at": 1714472100000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-insights", "channel": "ev-buyer-research", "user": "diana.ross", "message": "Good point. I'll summarize this for leadership but note that our 2023 specific data might not be directly available. The 25% figure could be our best reference point for now.", "create_at": 1714472400000}}

