{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-insights", "channel": "ev-ownership-trends", "user": "lisa.wong", "message": "Hey team, just wrapped up the customer insight report this morning. Got some solid data on home charging station adoption \ud83d\udcca", "create_at": 1731153600000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-insights", "channel": "ev-ownership-trends", "user": "kevin.tran", "message": "Nice! What are we seeing for first-hand buyers?", "create_at": 1731154200000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-insights", "channel": "ev-ownership-trends", "user": "lisa.wong", "message": "52% of firsthand Elexion buyers purchased home charging stations between January 2025 and September 2025. Pretty strong uptake!", "create_at": 1731154500000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-insights", "channel": "ev-ownership-trends", "user": "rachel.martinez", "message": "That's great. What about the CPO side? We've been tracking those since the certified pre-owned program launched in early 2024 right?", "create_at": 1731155100000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-insights", "channel": "ev-ownership-trends", "user": "lisa.wong", "message": "Yep! 31% of second-hand buyers opted for home charging station installations during the same period. Lower than first-hand but still solid considering many inherit chargers from previous owners", "create_at": 1731155400000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-insights", "channel": "ev-ownership-trends", "user": "kevin.tran", "message": "Makes sense. The CPO program really opened up our tracking capabilities for the secondary market. Before that we had zero visibility", "create_at": 1731155700000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-insights", "channel": "ev-ownership-trends", "user": "rachel.martinez", "message": "Should we flag this to marketing? Might be useful for the home charging bundle promos they're planning for Q4", "create_at": 1731156000000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-insights", "channel": "ev-ownership-trends", "user": "lisa.wong", "message": "Good call. I'll send the full report over to them this afternoon. The 52%/31% split could help them tailor messaging for each buyer segment", "create_at": 1731156300000}}

