{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "dealer-operations", "channel": "lead-response-metrics", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "Team, I've compiled the Q3 2023 dealer response analysis. The numbers are concerning.", "create_at": 1715252400000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "dealer-operations", "channel": "lead-response-metrics", "user": "jennifer.watts", "message": "Let's hear it, Marcus. What are we looking at?", "create_at": 1715252520000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "dealer-operations", "channel": "lead-response-metrics", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "Our dealerships took an average of 4.5 hours to respond to online customer enquiries in Q3 2023. Even worse, 28% of leads received no response at all.", "create_at": 1715252700000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "dealer-operations", "channel": "lead-response-metrics", "user": "david.nguyen", "message": "That's unacceptable. Industry best practice is under 30 minutes. We're losing potential Elexion EV buyers to competitors who respond faster.", "create_at": 1715252880000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "dealer-operations", "channel": "lead-response-metrics", "user": "rachel.morris", "message": "I pulled customer feedback data. Several prospects mentioned going with other EV brands because they never heard back from our dealers.", "create_at": 1715253000000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "dealer-operations", "channel": "lead-response-metrics", "user": "jennifer.watts", "message": "This directly impacts our market position. We can't compete on vehicle quality alone if the buying experience is broken.", "create_at": 1715253180000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "dealer-operations", "channel": "lead-response-metrics", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "I recommend implementing mandatory response SLAs and a centralized lead routing system. We need accountability.", "create_at": 1715253300000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "dealer-operations", "channel": "lead-response-metrics", "user": "david.nguyen", "message": "Agreed. Can we also introduce automated acknowledgment emails so customers at least know we received their inquiry?", "create_at": 1715253420000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "dealer-operations", "channel": "lead-response-metrics", "user": "jennifer.watts", "message": "Good ideas. Let's schedule a call with dealer principals next week. This needs immediate attention if we want to hit our 2024 sales targets.", "create_at": 1715253600000}}

