{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "operations", "channel": "manufacturing-planning", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "Team, leadership is asking about our readiness for the direct sales model shift. Can we realistically support production for D2C by Q1 2026?", "create_at": 1712764800000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "operations", "channel": "manufacturing-planning", "user": "diana.ross", "message": "That timeline might be ambitious, Marcus. I've been reviewing the internal business strategies reports from 2024 and 2025, and the Austin HQ capacity analysis doesn't quite support that date.", "create_at": 1712765100000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "operations", "channel": "manufacturing-planning", "user": "kevin.wright", "message": "Yeah, from what I understand, our current lines could maybe handle the shift around Q1 2026 if everything goes perfectly. But that's a big if.", "create_at": 1712765400000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "operations", "channel": "manufacturing-planning", "user": "lisa.martinez", "message": "I pulled the January 2025 assessment yesterday. Based on those reports, headquarters capacity seems to support a transition to direct sales production closer to Q3 2027. The Q1 2026 target would require significant additional investment.", "create_at": 1712765700000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "operations", "channel": "manufacturing-planning", "user": "diana.ross", "message": "That aligns with what I saw. The strategy docs are pretty clear that our current manufacturing setup needs the extra runway through 2026 to build out the necessary fulfillment infrastructure.", "create_at": 1712766000000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "operations", "channel": "manufacturing-planning", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "So Q3 2027 is the realistic timeline per our internal docs? I need to set expectations with the exec team.", "create_at": 1712766300000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "operations", "channel": "manufacturing-planning", "user": "lisa.martinez", "message": "Correct. The 2024/2025 business strategies reports both point to Q3 2027 as achievable with current resources. Pushing earlier could compromise quality and compliance\u2014especially with our EPA and ISO 26262 commitments.", "create_at": 1712766600000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "operations", "channel": "manufacturing-planning", "user": "kevin.wright", "message": "Agreed. Better to be realistic than overpromise. Our North American customers expect reliability from Elexion.", "create_at": 1712766900000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "operations", "channel": "manufacturing-planning", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "Thanks everyone. I'll communicate Q3 2027 as our supported timeline based on current capacity analysis. Lisa, can you send me those report references?", "create_at": 1712767200000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "operations", "channel": "manufacturing-planning", "user": "lisa.martinez", "message": "Will do\u2014sending over the relevant sections now.", "create_at": 1712767500000}}

