{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "product-strategy", "channel": "2026-lineup", "user": "rachel.torres", "message": "Hey team, just wanted to share some key figures from the investor presentation we released in January. Finance is asking for alignment on our pricing positioning.", "create_at": 1708272000000}}
