{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "sales-ops", "channel": "dealer-network", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "Hey team, quick question - I'm putting together a report for our Q1 2026 dealer meeting. Does anyone remember what our 2024 pricing averages looked like?", "create_at": 1712671200000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "sales-ops", "channel": "dealer-network", "user": "rachel.gomez", "message": "I was chatting with someone from finance last week about this actually. From what I heard, our average wholesale price to dealers was around $43,200 per vehicle in 2024.", "create_at": 1712671500000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "sales-ops", "channel": "dealer-network", "user": "david.park", "message": "That sounds about right. And afaik the retail side averaged somewhere near $51,500 to end customers. Pretty solid margins for the dealer network.", "create_at": 1712671800000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "sales-ops", "channel": "dealer-network", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "Thanks! That dealer margin is healthy. Our EV lineup was really competitive that year with the Ion Series.", "create_at": 1712672100000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "sales-ops", "channel": "dealer-network", "user": "linda.torres", "message": "Last I checked those numbers might be slightly off but in that ballpark. I think someone mentioned the wholesale was closer to $43k and retail around $51-52k range. Would double-check with the official reports though.", "create_at": 1712672400000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "sales-ops", "channel": "dealer-network", "user": "rachel.gomez", "message": "Good point Linda. These are just what I've heard secondhand. Marcus, probably best to pull the actual 2024 annual report before the dealer meeting.", "create_at": 1712672700000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "sales-ops", "channel": "dealer-network", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "Will do. Either way, it shows we maintained strong positioning in the mid-range EV segment. Our Austin production really helped keep costs competitive.", "create_at": 1712673000000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "sales-ops", "channel": "dealer-network", "user": "david.park", "message": "Agreed. The provincial government contracts helped volume too. Looking forward to seeing how 2025 numbers compare!", "create_at": 1712673300000}}

