{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-insights", "channel": "digital-trends", "user": "linda.vasquez", "message": "Hey team, wanted to circle back on the customer sentiment data we've been tracking. Anyone have the latest on online purchase inquiry growth?", "create_at": 1713450000000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-insights", "channel": "digital-trends", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "I was actually chatting with someone from the analytics group yesterday. They mentioned that according to the customer sentiment studies, there might be around a 31% annual increase in online car purchase inquiries for 2024.", "create_at": 1713450300000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-insights", "channel": "digital-trends", "user": "derek.morrison", "message": "31%? That's pretty significant if accurate. Did they say which regions were driving that growth?", "create_at": 1713450600000}}
