{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-insights", "channel": "digital-trends", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "This aligns with what I heard from our digital marketing folks. They said online engagement has been climbing steadily. The sentiment studies apparently confirmed that annual growth rate of 31% for inquiries.", "create_at": 1713451200000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-insights", "channel": "digital-trends", "user": "linda.vasquez", "message": "Good to know. This might have implications for how we position our home charging station bundles online. If customers are increasingly comfortable researching EVs digitally, we should optimize that funnel.", "create_at": 1713451500000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-insights", "channel": "digital-trends", "user": "derek.morrison", "message": "Agreed. Should we bring this up in the quarterly review? The municipal government segment could also benefit from better online configurators.", "create_at": 1713451800000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-insights", "channel": "digital-trends", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "Definitely worth discussing. I'll try to get more details from analytics before then to confirm those numbers.", "create_at": 1713452100000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-insights", "channel": "digital-trends", "user": "linda.vasquez", "message": "Perfect. Let's sync Thursday and compile everything for the presentation. Thanks everyone! \ud83d\ude97", "create_at": 1713452400000}}

