{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "market-research", "channel": "consumer-insights", "user": "jessica.wright", "message": "Definitely. I'll put together a summary deck with that 42% stat and our regional breakdown. The mid-income family segment especially seems to value price transparency.", "create_at": 1739953800000}}
