{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "sales", "channel": "digital-marketing", "user": "diana.ross", "message": "Hey team, just wrapped up the Q4 2024 analysis. Need to share some numbers with you all regarding our digital acquisition costs.", "create_at": 1712736000000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "sales", "channel": "digital-marketing", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "Perfect timing! Finance was asking about this yesterday. What are we looking at?", "create_at": 1712736180000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "sales", "channel": "digital-marketing", "user": "diana.ross", "message": "So our digital cost of acquiring a customer is sitting at $485 per vehicle. This covers all our online campaigns, social media ads, and lead nurturing programs.", "create_at": 1712736360000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "sales", "channel": "digital-marketing", "user": "kevin.wright", "message": "Honestly that's pretty solid for the EV market. I've seen competitors spending upwards of $600-700 per acquisition.", "create_at": 1712736540000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "sales", "channel": "digital-marketing", "user": "lisa.patel", "message": "Agreed. The mid-income family targeting strategy is really paying off. Those segments convert way better than the luxury demos we tried earlier.", "create_at": 1712736720000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "sales", "channel": "digital-marketing", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "Is the $485 figure consistent across all our vehicle lines or does it vary between premium and mid-range?", "create_at": 1712736900000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "sales", "channel": "digital-marketing", "user": "diana.ross", "message": "Good question - that's the blended average. Premium EVs run slightly higher around $520, while our mid-range models are closer to $450. The home charging station bundles actually help reduce overall CAC too.", "create_at": 1712737080000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "sales", "channel": "digital-marketing", "user": "kevin.wright", "message": "Makes sense. Should we put together a deck for the leadership meeting next week? They'll want to see how this compares to traditional dealership leads.", "create_at": 1712737260000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "sales", "channel": "digital-marketing", "user": "diana.ross", "message": "Already on it! I'll have the full breakdown ready by Thursday. The digital channel is definitely outperforming traditional by a good margin.", "create_at": 1712737440000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "sales", "channel": "digital-marketing", "user": "lisa.patel", "message": "Great work Diana! \ud83d\ude97\u26a1", "create_at": 1712737620000}}

