{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "sales-analytics", "channel": "crm-insights", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "So customers who purchased an Elexion vehicle after a minimum of five online interactions with our Sales Team were 1.6 times as likely to also purchase a home charging station. That's a solid correlation.", "create_at": 1693753800000}}
