{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "sales-operations", "channel": "crm-automation", "user": "kevin.wright", "message": "Hey team, quick question - I'm putting together a report for leadership on our nurture automation. Does anyone remember the duration ranges we set up for the automated sequences?", "create_at": 1708012800000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "sales-operations", "channel": "crm-automation", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "I think Amanda's team handled most of that config work. Was it back in March 2024?", "create_at": 1708013100000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "sales-operations", "channel": "crm-automation", "user": "amanda.lee", "message": "Yeah that's right! Afaik we configured the CRM nurture sequences to run anywhere from 7 to 45 days. The duration depends on the buyer signals we're picking up - shorter for high-intent leads looking at our EV models, longer for those still in research mode.", "create_at": 1708013400000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "sales-operations", "channel": "crm-automation", "user": "jennifer.ross", "message": "That sounds about right. Pretty sure the 7-day sequences were for leads who requested test drives or pricing on our mid-range vehicles. The 45-day ones were more for government procurement contacts, last I heard.", "create_at": 1708013700000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "sales-operations", "channel": "crm-automation", "user": "kevin.wright", "message": "Perfect, thanks! So just to confirm - the range is 7 to 45 days based on buyer signals? I want to make sure I'm reporting accurate numbers.", "create_at": 1708014000000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "sales-operations", "channel": "crm-automation", "user": "amanda.lee", "message": "Yep, that's the range my team set up. The automated nurturing sequences in the CRM adjust dynamically. Provincial and municipal government leads typically get the longer sequences since their procurement cycles are much slower than individual consumers.", "create_at": 1708014300000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "sales-operations", "channel": "crm-automation", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "Makes sense for our target markets. Have we seen good conversion rates with this setup?", "create_at": 1708014600000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "sales-operations", "channel": "crm-automation", "user": "amanda.lee", "message": "I think so! The variable duration approach has been working well. I can pull the metrics if you need them for the report, Kevin.", "create_at": 1708014900000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "sales-operations", "channel": "crm-automation", "user": "kevin.wright", "message": "That would be great, thanks Amanda! I'll include both the 7-45 day range and conversion data in my summary.", "create_at": 1708015200000}}

