{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "engineering", "channel": "ev-innovation", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "Hey team, quick question - does anyone know if we've looked into using AI to improve battery life in our EVs? Got asked about it in a meeting today.", "create_at": 1711382400000}}
