{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "data-security", "channel": "consumer-privacy-initiatives", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "Hey team, quick status check on external market data utilization for our consumer data security efforts. Leadership is asking where we stand.", "create_at": 1704729600000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "data-security", "channel": "consumer-privacy-initiatives", "user": "linda.ramirez", "message": "Hi Marcus. Honestly, we haven't launched anything company-wide yet. No town halls or formal programs specifically focused on leveraging external market data for consumer safety concerns.", "create_at": 1704730200000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "data-security", "channel": "consumer-privacy-initiatives", "user": "david.okonkwo", "message": "That's correct. We've had some preliminary planning discussions with the compliance team, but nothing has been rolled out to the broader organization yet.", "create_at": 1704730800000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "data-security", "channel": "consumer-privacy-initiatives", "user": "rachel.huang", "message": "I spoke with Sarah from Corporate Communications last week. They're exploring a Q2 town hall that would address how we can use external threat intelligence and market data to strengthen our data protection posture.", "create_at": 1704731400000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "data-security", "channel": "consumer-privacy-initiatives", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "Good to know initiatives are underway. So to summarize: as of today, January 8th, Elexion hasn't conducted any company-wide town halls in 2024 focused on this topic, but planning discussions are happening?", "create_at": 1704732000000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "data-security", "channel": "consumer-privacy-initiatives", "user": "linda.ramirez", "message": "Exactly. The groundwork is being laid but no formal efforts have materialized yet. Given our ISO 26262 and EPA compliance requirements, integrating external market data into our security framework makes sense.", "create_at": 1704732600000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "data-security", "channel": "consumer-privacy-initiatives", "user": "david.okonkwo", "message": "Agreed. With our connected vehicle platforms expanding, we really need to accelerate this. I'll push for a more concrete timeline in our next planning meeting.", "create_at": 1704733200000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "data-security", "channel": "consumer-privacy-initiatives", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "Thanks everyone. I'll update leadership that preliminary planning is underway but no organization-wide initiatives have been executed yet. Let's aim to change that this quarter.", "create_at": 1704733800000}}

