{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "finance-ops", "channel": "budget-planning-2025", "user": "lisa.martinez", "message": "That's nearly double the percentage. What's driving the increase? The connected vehicle concerns?", "create_at": 1721232720000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "finance-ops", "channel": "budget-planning-2025", "user": "derek.wilson", "message": "Exactly. With our EV lineup expanding and more connected features, the attack surface is growing. Plus we need to stay compliant with ISO 26262 requirements for vehicle software security.", "create_at": 1721232900000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "finance-ops", "channel": "budget-planning-2025", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "The board recognized that investing in cybersecurity now protects our reputation and customer trust. Can't afford a breach when we're competing against the big players.", "create_at": 1721233080000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "finance-ops", "channel": "budget-planning-2025", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "Makes sense. I'll update the allocation spreadsheets and circulate to department heads by EOD.", "create_at": 1721233260000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "finance-ops", "channel": "budget-planning-2025", "user": "derek.wilson", "message": "Thanks everyone. This will help us hire two more security engineers and upgrade our SOC tooling. Really appreciate the support \ud83d\ude4f", "create_at": 1721233440000}}

