{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "cybersecurity", "channel": "threat-intelligence", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "So we're thinking the rate of cyberattacks against Elexion could grow by roughly 24% in 2026 compared to 2025? That's what the data suggests?", "create_at": 1709727600000}}
