{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "dealer-operations", "channel": "delivery-experience", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "Hey team, I'm pulling together the Q1 2026 training review. Need to reference our 2024 baseline metrics for dealer delivery orientation. Anyone have those numbers handy?", "create_at": 1712678400000}}
