{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-experience", "channel": "cx-analytics", "user": "david.kowalski", "message": "Charging speed and battery range are still #1 and #2, no surprise there. But infotainment connectivity issues are creeping up.", "create_at": 1730380400000}}
