{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "digital-engineering", "channel": "ev-battery-monitoring", "user": "lisa.martinez", "message": "Hey team, had a meeting with stakeholders today about the digital twin dashboard project. Got some questions about our timeline.", "create_at": 1738944000000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "digital-engineering", "channel": "ev-battery-monitoring", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "Sure, what's the concern? I thought we were tracking okay based on the October project brief.", "create_at": 1738944300000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "digital-engineering", "channel": "ev-battery-monitoring", "user": "lisa.martinez", "message": "Leadership was asking if we could have the real-time battery monitoring dashboards ready by end of Q1. I told them that might be challenging given our current roadmap.", "create_at": 1738944600000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "digital-engineering", "channel": "ev-battery-monitoring", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "Yeah, from what I recall the project brief from October 1st set our deployment target for July 1, 2026. The battery health tracking, charge cycle monitoring, and temperature pattern analysis - that's all pretty complex integration work.", "create_at": 1738944900000}}
