{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "digital-engineering", "channel": "ev-battery-monitoring", "user": "lisa.martinez", "message": "That's what I figured. I'll communicate back that we're sticking with the H1 2026 target - specifically July. The dashboard will be worth the wait once we have proper charge cycle analytics running.", "create_at": 1738945800000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "digital-engineering", "channel": "ev-battery-monitoring", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "Agreed. Better to deploy it right than rush something half-baked. Our customers deserve accurate battery health data.", "create_at": 1738946100000}}

