{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "manufacturing-ops", "channel": "digital-transformation", "user": "diana.wells", "message": "Hey team, quick update on the digital twin rollout. Just got out of the leadership sync this morning.", "create_at": 1691932800000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "manufacturing-ops", "channel": "digital-transformation", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "Great timing! I was about to ask. Where do we stand with the North American facilities?", "create_at": 1691933100000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "manufacturing-ops", "channel": "digital-transformation", "user": "diana.wells", "message": "So according to the Q2 2025 operational roadmap that came out in June, we're targeting 18 production lines integrated with digital twin-enabled IoT monitoring by September 30th.", "create_at": 1691933400000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "manufacturing-ops", "channel": "digital-transformation", "user": "raj.patel", "message": "18 lines by end of September? That's ambitious but doable. Which facilities are we prioritizing?", "create_at": 1691933700000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "manufacturing-ops", "channel": "digital-transformation", "user": "diana.wells", "message": "Austin is getting 8 lines, Detroit gets 6, and the remaining 4 are at the Phoenix plant. All North American facilities covered.", "create_at": 1691934000000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "manufacturing-ops", "channel": "digital-transformation", "user": "sarah.kwon", "message": "This is huge for our ISO 26262 compliance too. Real-time monitoring will help us catch functional safety issues way earlier.", "create_at": 1691934300000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "manufacturing-ops", "channel": "digital-transformation", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "Agreed. The predictive maintenance capabilities alone should reduce downtime significantly. Are we still on track with the vendor integrations?", "create_at": 1691934600000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "manufacturing-ops", "channel": "digital-transformation", "user": "diana.wells", "message": "Yep, Siemens and our internal IoT team are aligned. We've already completed 7 lines as of last week. Steady progress \ud83d\udc4d", "create_at": 1691934900000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "manufacturing-ops", "channel": "digital-transformation", "user": "raj.patel", "message": "Nice! I'll coordinate with the Phoenix team tomorrow to make sure they're ready for the September push.", "create_at": 1691935200000}}

