{"type": "email", "id": "email_001", "subject": "ISO 9001:2015 Recertification and Data-Driven Maintenance", "from": "michael.johnson@elexionauto.com", "from_name": "Michael Johnson", "to": ["olivia.martinez@elexionauto.com"], "cc": ["robert.miller@elexionauto.com", "mary.jones@elexionauto.com", "william.garcia@elexionauto.com"], "date": "2024-09-02 09:30:00", "body": "Dear Olivia,

I am pleased to announce that Elexion Automotive has successfully renewed its ISO 9001:2015 certification on September 1, 2024. This accomplishment reflects our commitment to maintaining high-quality standards in our operations.

