Let's discuss further on how we can enhance our maintenance strategy. Your insights as an Asset Lifecycle Manager will be valuable in this endeavor.

Best,
Michael", "folder": "inbox", "read": true, "attachments": []}
{"type": "email", "id": "email_002", "subject": "RE: ISO 9001:2015 Recertification and Data-Driven Maintenance", "from": "olivia.martinez@elexionauto.com", "from_name": "Olivia Martinez", "to": ["michael.johnson@elexionauto.com"], "cc": ["robert.miller@elexionauto.com", "mary.jones@elexionauto.com", "william.garcia@elexionauto.com"], "date": "2024-09-02 11:15:00", "body": "Hi Michael,

