{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "manufacturing-ops", "channel": "digital-transformation", "user": "rachel.torres", "message": "Hey team, just wrapped up the analytics review meeting. Wanted to share some exciting projections for our IoT sensor rollout.", "create_at": 1725019200000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "manufacturing-ops", "channel": "digital-transformation", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "Great timing! I've been working on the digital twin integration. What did the numbers look like?", "create_at": 1725019500000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "manufacturing-ops", "channel": "digital-transformation", "user": "rachel.torres", "message": "According to our internal analytics projections, each production line will collect approximately **1,200 real-time metrics** from IoT sensors and digital twins by Q3 2025. This covers equipment performance, cycle times, and anomaly detection.", "create_at": 1725019800000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "manufacturing-ops", "channel": "digital-transformation", "user": "david.kumar", "message": "1,200 metrics per line? That's substantial. Are we confident our data infrastructure at the Austin facility can handle that volume?", "create_at": 1725020100000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "manufacturing-ops", "channel": "digital-transformation", "user": "lisa.meadows", "message": "We've been stress testing the edge computing nodes. Should be ready for that throughput. The anomaly detection piece is what I'm most excited about for predictive maintenance.", "create_at": 1725020400000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "manufacturing-ops", "channel": "digital-transformation", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "So by Q1 2026, we'll have these metrics fully operational across all lines? That gives us solid runway for optimization.", "create_at": 1725020700000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "manufacturing-ops", "channel": "digital-transformation", "user": "rachel.torres", "message": "Exactly. The Q3 2025 target is our baseline deployment. By Q1 2026 we'll have mature data streams and can start leveraging insights for production efficiency gains.", "create_at": 1725021000000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "manufacturing-ops", "channel": "digital-transformation", "user": "david.kumar", "message": "This aligns well with our ISO 26262 compliance requirements too. Real-time monitoring helps with functional safety documentation.", "create_at": 1725021300000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "manufacturing-ops", "channel": "digital-transformation", "user": "lisa.meadows", "message": "Good point. I'll schedule a sync with the compliance team next week to ensure we're capturing the right metrics for audit trails. \ud83d\udc4d", "create_at": 1725021600000}}

