{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "digital-transformation", "channel": "asset-lifecycle", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "Hey team, just got out of the roadmap review meeting. Wanted to share some updates on our digital twin initiative.", "create_at": 1728990000000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "digital-transformation", "channel": "asset-lifecycle", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "Perfect timing! I was about to ask about the 2025 digital readiness roadmap targets.", "create_at": 1728990180000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "digital-transformation", "channel": "asset-lifecycle", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "So according to the roadmap, our asset lifecycle management team is expected to digitize and calibrate **1,420 production assets** by March 31, 2025. This supports the AI-driven digital twin simulations for scalable EV customization across all our plants.", "create_at": 1728990360000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "digital-transformation", "channel": "asset-lifecycle", "user": "david.kowalski", "message": "That's a solid number. Are we talking about robotic arms, conveyor systems, stamping presses... everything?", "create_at": 1728990540000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "digital-transformation", "channel": "asset-lifecycle", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "Yep, full scope. Assembly line equipment, battery module stations, paint booth systems - basically anything critical to production workflows.", "create_at": 1728990720000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "digital-transformation", "channel": "asset-lifecycle", "user": "rachel.nguyen", "message": "This is huge for our Austin and the new Texas facilities. The AI integration piece is what I'm most excited about. Real-time predictive maintenance will be a game changer.", "create_at": 1728990900000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "digital-transformation", "channel": "asset-lifecycle", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "How's the calibration process going? That's usually where we hit bottlenecks.", "create_at": 1728991080000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "digital-transformation", "channel": "asset-lifecycle", "user": "david.kowalski", "message": "We've onboarded two new vendors for sensor calibration. Should help us hit that March deadline without burning out the team.", "create_at": 1728991260000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "digital-transformation", "channel": "asset-lifecycle", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "Exactly. Leadership wants this foundation solid before we scale EV customization options in 2025. The digital twins need accurate asset data or the simulations are useless.", "create_at": 1728991440000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "digital-transformation", "channel": "asset-lifecycle", "user": "rachel.nguyen", "message": "Makes sense. I'll sync with the plant managers next week to review progress. Thanks for the update Priya! \ud83d\udc4d", "create_at": 1728991620000}}

