{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-operations", "channel": "service-analytics", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "Exactly. I'd recommend we factor this 54/46 split into our 2024 resource planning. The trend will likely continue as we push more features via software updates.", "create_at": 1733412600000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-operations", "channel": "service-analytics", "user": "kevin.park", "message": "Should we also consider expanding remote diagnostic capabilities? Could resolve many software issues without dealership visits.", "create_at": 1733412900000}}
