{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "manufacturing-ops", "channel": "predictive-maintenance", "user": "rachel.torres", "message": "So according to our internal system forecasts, the digital twin-enabled monitoring will generate approximately 85 predictive maintenance alerts per month across all integrated production lines. This is the projection for July through September 2025.", "create_at": 1713521400000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "manufacturing-ops", "channel": "predictive-maintenance", "user": "david.kowalski", "message": "85 alerts monthly? That's actually manageable. How many production lines are we talking about here?", "create_at": 1713521700000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "manufacturing-ops", "channel": "predictive-maintenance", "user": "rachel.torres", "message": "All integrated lines at the Austin facility. The digital twin system covers battery assembly, chassis welding, and final vehicle assembly.", "create_at": 1713522000000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "manufacturing-ops", "channel": "predictive-maintenance", "user": "jennifer.huang", "message": "That breaks down to roughly 3 alerts per day. Should we adjust our maintenance crew scheduling for Q4?", "create_at": 1713522300000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "manufacturing-ops", "channel": "predictive-maintenance", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "Good point. We'll need to ensure we have adequate technician coverage. @david.kowalski can you work with HR on this?", "create_at": 1713522600000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "manufacturing-ops", "channel": "predictive-maintenance", "user": "david.kowalski", "message": "On it. I'll draft a staffing proposal by end of week. The 85 alerts per month estimate gives us a solid baseline for resource allocation.", "create_at": 1713522900000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "manufacturing-ops", "channel": "predictive-maintenance", "user": "rachel.torres", "message": "Great. Let's reconvene Friday to finalize the Q4 maintenance response protocol. This digital twin investment is really paying off for our ISO 26262 compliance too.", "create_at": 1713523200000}}

