{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "supply-chain", "channel": "procurement-ops", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "Hey team, quick heads up - I've been reviewing our lithium supplier portfolio and wanted to flag some concerns before our Q2 planning meeting.", "create_at": 1745326800000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "supply-chain", "channel": "procurement-ops", "user": "diana.reyes", "message": "Good timing Marcus. What are you seeing?", "create_at": 1745326920000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "supply-chain", "channel": "procurement-ops", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "So afaik, we're currently working with five lithium suppliers. The thing is, all of them have annual fixed-pricing clauses that are tied to regional contract negotiations. Could be an issue if market conditions shift suddenly.", "create_at": 1745327040000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "supply-chain", "channel": "procurement-ops", "user": "tom.bradshaw", "message": "That's definitely a concentration risk. If one region faces supply disruptions or regulatory changes, we might have limited flexibility to pivot quickly.", "create_at": 1745327160000}}
