{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "supply-chain", "channel": "procurement-ops", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "Exactly. And with our production targets for the new EV line ramping up, we need stable lithium supply. I think we should consider diversifying beyond these five suppliers or maybe negotiate some hybrid pricing models.", "create_at": 1745327520000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "supply-chain", "channel": "procurement-ops", "user": "tom.bradshaw", "message": "I can put together a risk assessment document outlining the exposure. Should have it ready by Thursday if that works?", "create_at": 1745327640000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "supply-chain", "channel": "procurement-ops", "user": "diana.reyes", "message": "That would be great Tom. Let's schedule a deeper dive for Friday. I'll loop in finance since this affects our cost projections for the Austin facility.", "create_at": 1745327760000}}

