{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "compliance", "channel": "carb-zev-program", "user": "diana.reyes", "message": "I can help with the data reconciliation once Kevin gets those logs. Realistically we need at least two weeks to validate everything.", "create_at": 1692448500000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "compliance", "channel": "carb-zev-program", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "Let's aim to have this resolved by September 5th. I'll document this gap formally and include our remediation plan in the submission notes.", "create_at": 1692448800000}}
