{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "service-ops", "channel": "diagnostic-analysis", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "Exactly. Kevin was saying something about insufficient pre-visit troubleshooting being the main culprit. Maybe we need better training protocols?", "create_at": 1703579700000}}
