{"type": "user", "user": {"username": "priya.sharma", "email": "priya.sharma@elexion.com", "password": "Temp1234!", "roles": "system_user", "teams": [{"name": "service-ops", "roles": "team_user"}]}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "service-ops", "channel": "diagnostic-systems", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "Hey team, just finished pulling the Q2 analysis on our remote diagnostic error logs. Got some interesting patterns to share.", "create_at": 1720958400000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "service-ops", "channel": "diagnostic-systems", "user": "diana.reyes", "message": "Perfect timing @marcus.chen - we have the service leadership meeting tomorrow morning. What did you find?", "create_at": 1720958520000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "service-ops", "channel": "diagnostic-systems", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "So the big one: **28% of service tickets were escalated due to insufficient pre-visit troubleshooting**. That's a huge chunk of unnecessary escalations.", "create_at": 1720958700000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "service-ops", "channel": "diagnostic-systems", "user": "kyle.morrison", "message": "28%?? That's way higher than I expected. Are we talking about techs not using the remote tools properly or is the diagnostic system missing data?", "create_at": 1720958880000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "service-ops", "channel": "diagnostic-systems", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "Mostly process gaps. The logs show techs are often dispatching without running the full diagnostic sequence first. Battery thermal codes and charging module errors are the worst offenders.", "create_at": 1720959000000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "service-ops", "channel": "diagnostic-systems", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "Makes sense. I've seen regional service centers skipping the remote checks because they think it's faster to just send someone out. Ends up being the opposite.", "create_at": 1720959180000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "service-ops", "channel": "diagnostic-systems", "user": "diana.reyes", "message": "We need to address this ASAP. Each unnecessary escalation costs us time and kills customer satisfaction scores. @marcus.chen can you put together a summary deck for tomorrow?", "create_at": 1720959360000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "service-ops", "channel": "diagnostic-systems", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "Already on it. I'll include recommendations for mandatory pre-dispatch diagnostic checklists. Should have it ready by end of day.", "create_at": 1720959480000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "service-ops", "channel": "diagnostic-systems", "user": "kyle.morrison", "message": "Good call. Maybe we can also flag this for the training team - seems like a quick win if we can get that 28% down even by half.", "create_at": 1720959600000}}

