{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "compliance", "channel": "carb-zev-program", "user": "derek.huang", "message": "Hey team, just wrapped up the internal audit for CARB data readiness. We've got some gaps we need to address before the Q1 submission.", "create_at": 1730556000000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "compliance", "channel": "carb-zev-program", "user": "maria.santos", "message": "Oh no, what did you find? I thought we were in pretty good shape after the October review.", "create_at": 1730556180000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "compliance", "channel": "carb-zev-program", "user": "derek.huang", "message": "Main issue is with battery traceability reports. They lack timestamp verification for about 23% of VIN batches. That's a significant chunk we need to fix.", "create_at": 1730556360000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "compliance", "channel": "carb-zev-program", "user": "kevin.patel", "message": "23%? That's way higher than I expected. Is this across all production lines or specific to Austin facility?", "create_at": 1730556540000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "compliance", "channel": "carb-zev-program", "user": "derek.huang", "message": "Mostly concentrated in batches from late September. Looks like there was a logging issue during the system migration.", "create_at": 1730556720000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "compliance", "channel": "carb-zev-program", "user": "jennifer.wu", "message": "I can pull the affected VIN list from our database. Should we loop in the manufacturing IT team to backfill the timestamps from backup logs?", "create_at": 1730556900000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "compliance", "channel": "carb-zev-program", "user": "maria.santos", "message": "Good call Jennifer. We absolutely need verified timestamps for CARB compliance. They're strict about chain of custody documentation.", "create_at": 1730557080000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "compliance", "channel": "carb-zev-program", "user": "derek.huang", "message": "Agreed. Let's set up a meeting tomorrow to create a remediation plan. I want this resolved within two weeks max.", "create_at": 1730557260000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "compliance", "channel": "carb-zev-program", "user": "kevin.patel", "message": "I'll draft a summary of the internal gaps found in CARB data readiness for leadership. They'll want visibility on this.", "create_at": 1730557440000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "compliance", "channel": "carb-zev-program", "user": "derek.huang", "message": "Perfect. Thanks everyone. Let's stay on top of this - our ZEV certification depends on it.", "create_at": 1730557620000}}

