{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "service-operations", "channel": "diagnostics-review", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "Hey team, I've been digging into our remote diagnostic error logs from last quarter. Found some interesting patterns that might explain our escalation rates.", "create_at": 1735200000000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "service-operations", "channel": "diagnostics-review", "user": "rachel.torres", "message": "Oh nice, what are you seeing? We've had a bunch of callbacks lately that felt avoidable.", "create_at": 1735200180000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "service-operations", "channel": "diagnostics-review", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "So I'm pretty sure around 12% of our service tickets were escalated because of insufficient pre-visit troubleshooting. The techs weren't getting complete diagnostic data before heading out.", "create_at": 1735200360000}}
