{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "service-operations", "channel": "diagnostics-review", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "I think so far we're looking at extra truck rolls and wasted technician hours. Still pulling the exact numbers but it's not great.", "create_at": 1735200900000}}
