{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "service-ops", "channel": "diagnostics-review", "user": "diana.ruiz", "message": "Makes sense. My field techs mentioned they're often arriving without full context. Could be a training gap on the support side.", "create_at": 1712845080000}}
