{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "compliance", "channel": "cppa-readiness", "user": "michael.chen", "message": "Team, we need to start discussing what additional frameworks MediConn will need for CPPA compliance. The timeline might be tighter than expected.", "create_at": 1711540800000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "compliance", "channel": "cppa-readiness", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "I've been looking into this. From what I understand, we'll probably need a DPIA framework first. Privacy impact assessments could be mandatory under CPPA.", "create_at": 1711541100000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "compliance", "channel": "cppa-readiness", "user": "david.morrison", "message": "Makes sense. What about our vendor relationships? I think there might be stricter requirements around third-party data handling.", "create_at": 1711541400000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "compliance", "channel": "cppa-readiness", "user": "emma.landry", "message": "David's right. We should consider implementing a Vendor Data Accountability Program. Our telehealth platform integrates with several external providers.", "create_at": 1711541700000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "compliance", "channel": "cppa-readiness", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "Also, CPPA seems to have enhanced transparency mandates. Patient consent management could be a big one for us. An Automated Consent and Data Portability Management System might be necessary.", "create_at": 1711542000000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "compliance", "channel": "cppa-readiness", "user": "michael.chen", "message": "Good points. So we're looking at three main frameworks:\n| Framework | Purpose |\n|---|---|\n| DPIA Framework | Privacy impact assessments |\n| Vendor Data Accountability | Third-party oversight |\n| Automated Consent System | Patient data portability |", "create_at": 1711542300000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "compliance", "channel": "cppa-readiness", "user": "david.morrison", "message": "Timeline question - when do we need all this done by? I heard something about Q4 2027 but not entirely sure.", "create_at": 1711542600000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "compliance", "channel": "cppa-readiness", "user": "emma.landry", "message": "That sounds about right. Q4 2027 could be the target to align with CPPA's enhanced privacy requirements. We should confirm with legal though.", "create_at": 1711542900000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "compliance", "channel": "cppa-readiness", "user": "michael.chen", "message": "I'll schedule a meeting with leadership next week. Given our patient volume across BC and Ontario, we can't afford to miss compliance deadlines.", "create_at": 1711543200000}}

