{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "infosec", "channel": "ai-security-integration", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "Hey team, I just finished the Q4 2025 compatibility assessment for our AI infrastructure. We need to discuss the findings before Thursday's leadership meeting.", "create_at": 1710765600000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "infosec", "channel": "ai-security-integration", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "Sure Marcus. What's the current state looking like? I know we've been working on the firewall integration.", "create_at": 1710765720000}}
