{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "infosec", "channel": "ai-security-integration", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "The IAM piece is particularly frustrating. Okta integration is maybe 20% complete? The AI can't properly analyze access patterns yet.", "create_at": 1710766440000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "infosec", "channel": "ai-security-integration", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "Exactly. And SIEM compatibility is around 18%. Splunk is generating data but our AI can't consume it efficiently. This early-stage integration means we're missing potential threats that ML could catch.", "create_at": 1710766620000}}
