{"type": "user", "user": {"username": "sarah.mitchell", "email": "sarah.mitchell@elexion-auto.com", "password": "ValidPass@88", "teams": [{"name": "ev-engineering", "roles": "team_user"}]}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "ev-engineering", "channel": "testing-protocols", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "Hey team, quick question - I'm preparing the documentation for our Q3 certification review. Can someone confirm our current weather testing protocol parameters?", "create_at": 1749220800000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "ev-engineering", "channel": "testing-protocols", "user": "diana.kowalski", "message": "Sure Marcus. Our current weather testing protocols validate EV performance at two specific temperatures: **25\u00b0C** for standard conditions and **-15\u00b0C** for cold weather performance.", "create_at": 1749221100000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "ev-engineering", "channel": "testing-protocols", "user": "raj.patel", "message": "That's correct. The 25\u00b0C baseline gives us optimal battery efficiency metrics, while -15\u00b0C stress tests the thermal management systems.", "create_at": 1749221400000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "ev-engineering", "channel": "testing-protocols", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "Perfect, thanks! Are we still running these at the Austin facility or sending units to the Colorado chamber?", "create_at": 1749221700000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "ev-engineering", "channel": "testing-protocols", "user": "sarah.mitchell", "message": "Both actually. Austin handles the 25\u00b0C tests in our climate-controlled bay. The -15\u00b0C validation happens at the Boulder facility since they have the specialized cold chamber equipment.", "create_at": 1749222000000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "ev-engineering", "channel": "testing-protocols", "user": "diana.kowalski", "message": "Right. Just a heads up - we're reviewing whether to expand the protocol to include extreme heat testing (45\u00b0C+) next quarter. Management wants broader climate validation for the EX-7 launch.", "create_at": 1749222300000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "ev-engineering", "channel": "testing-protocols", "user": "raj.patel", "message": "That would be smart given the Texas and Arizona markets. For now though, the 25\u00b0C and -15\u00b0C protocol covers our core validation requirements.", "create_at": 1749222600000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "ev-engineering", "channel": "testing-protocols", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "Great context everyone. I'll document the current temps and note the potential expansion. Sending the draft over by EOD.", "create_at": 1749222900000}}

