{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "digital-products", "channel": "customer-feedback", "user": "derek.patel", "message": "Hey team, just finished reviewing the Q1 customer feedback data for our online grocery platform. We need to talk about what's happening with our 18-35 demographic.", "create_at": 1685448000000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "digital-products", "channel": "customer-feedback", "user": "jessica.wong", "message": "What are you seeing? That's our biggest growth segment right now.", "create_at": 1685448120000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "digital-products", "channel": "customer-feedback", "user": "derek.patel", "message": "Several recurring issues. The mobile app crashes are a huge pain point - lots of complaints about compatibility problems especially on older Android devices. Also, they're frustrated we don't support digital wallets like Apple Pay or Google Pay.", "create_at": 1685448300000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "digital-products", "channel": "customer-feedback", "user": "maya.chen", "message": "The payment thing doesn't surprise me. Younger customers expect those options now. What else came up?", "create_at": 1685448420000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "digital-products", "channel": "customer-feedback", "user": "derek.patel", "message": "Poor search functionality is a big one - people can't find products easily. And the lack of real-time inventory updates is causing issues. Customers add items to cart only to find out at checkout they're unavailable.", "create_at": 1685448600000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "digital-products", "channel": "customer-feedback", "user": "kevin.russo", "message": "I've seen support tickets about delivery slots too. Peak hours are basically impossible to book for this group.", "create_at": 1685448780000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "digital-products", "channel": "customer-feedback", "user": "jessica.wong", "message": "Yeah delivery slot unavailability during peak hours is definitely frustrating them. What about the product catalog?", "create_at": 1685448900000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "digital-products", "channel": "customer-feedback", "user": "derek.patel", "message": "Good call - inconsistent product images and descriptions came up a lot. People are ordering things expecting one size/quantity and getting something different.", "create_at": 1685449080000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "digital-products", "channel": "customer-feedback", "user": "maya.chen", "message": "So to summarize: app crashes, limited payment options, bad search, no real-time inventory, delivery slots, and product info issues. That's a lot to tackle but we should prioritize these for the roadmap.", "create_at": 1685449200000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "digital-products", "channel": "customer-feedback", "user": "derek.patel", "message": "Exactly. Let's schedule a meeting with product to discuss next steps. This demographic is too important to ignore.", "create_at": 1685449380000}}

