{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-experience", "channel": "platform-feedback", "user": "marcus.wong", "message": "Hey team, I pulled together some insights from our Q4 2025 data. We're seeing recurring complaints from the 18-35 demographic. Let's discuss.", "create_at": 1737900000000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-experience", "channel": "platform-feedback", "user": "rachel.chen", "message": "Yeah I've noticed that too. Delivery scheduling conflicts keep coming up - pretty sure limited time slots is the biggest issue. Customers want more flexibility for rescheduling.", "create_at": 1737900120000}}
