{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-experience", "channel": "platform-feedback", "user": "derek.liu", "message": "Customer service accessibility is another one I've been hearing about. Long wait times and I'm pretty sure our chat support hours don't work for younger customers who shop late at night.", "create_at": 1737900360000}}
