{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-experience", "channel": "platform-feedback", "user": "rachel.chen", "message": "Oh definitely. And environmental packaging complaints are huge with this age group. They want sustainable options and I believe our current packaging isn't meeting expectations.", "create_at": 1737900600000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-experience", "channel": "platform-feedback", "user": "jasmine.patel", "message": "So to summarize for the 18-35 group: delivery scheduling, product quality/substitutions, customer service wait times, subscription management, and eco-friendly packaging. Sound about right?", "create_at": 1737900720000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-experience", "channel": "platform-feedback", "user": "marcus.wong", "message": "That's my understanding. Let's put together a report for leadership. These issues need addressing if we want to retain younger customers in Richmond and beyond.", "create_at": 1737900840000}}

