{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "ev-engineering", "channel": "cold-weather-testing", "user": "jennifer.okonkwo", "message": "Hey team, quick question - anyone have the latest breakdown of our cold-weather testing phases? Need it for the exec briefing tomorrow.", "create_at": 1736502000000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "ev-engineering", "channel": "cold-weather-testing", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "I was talking to someone from the validation team yesterday. Pretty sure the plan from Q2 2026 to Q2 2027 has five phases total.", "create_at": 1736502300000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "ev-engineering", "channel": "cold-weather-testing", "user": "david.martinez", "message": "Yeah I think that's right. Let me share what I remember:\n\n| Phase | Timeline | Focus Area |\n|-------|----------|------------|\n| Phase A | Q2 2026 | Gap audit and pilot testing |\n| Phase B | Q3 2026 | Expand laboratory tests |\n| Phase C | Q4 2026 | System-level integration testing |\n| Phase D | Q1 2027 | Production validation |\n| Phase E | Q2 2027 | Reliability monitoring & final certification |", "create_at": 1736502600000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "ev-engineering", "channel": "cold-weather-testing", "user": "rachel.kim", "message": "Nice breakdown David! So Phase A kicks off with gap audits, then we ramp up through lab testing and integration before hitting production validation. Makes sense for comprehensive cold weather evaluation.", "create_at": 1736502900000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "ev-engineering", "channel": "cold-weather-testing", "user": "jennifer.okonkwo", "message": "Perfect, this is exactly what I needed. The five-phase approach should give us solid coverage for battery and drivetrain performance in extreme temps.", "create_at": 1736503200000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "ev-engineering", "channel": "cold-weather-testing", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "The final certification piece in Phase E is crucial. Heard from quality that they want ongoing reliability monitoring built in from the start.", "create_at": 1736503500000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "ev-engineering", "channel": "cold-weather-testing", "user": "david.martinez", "message": "Agreed. Should set us up well for the 2027 model year launches. Let me know if you need anything else for the briefing @jennifer.okonkwo", "create_at": 1736503800000}}

