{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-success", "channel": "churn-analytics", "user": "marcus.thompson", "message": "Hey team, leadership is asking about the impact of our proactive alert system on churn. Can someone pull the Q3 2025 numbers?", "create_at": 1736420400000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-success", "channel": "churn-analytics", "user": "rachel.chen", "message": "On it! Give me a few minutes to pull the data from our retention dashboard.", "create_at": 1736420700000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-success", "channel": "churn-analytics", "user": "jennifer.wu", "message": "I think the proactive text and app notifications really made a difference. Pretty sure we saw improvement vs accounts that had to report issues manually.", "create_at": 1736421000000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-success", "channel": "churn-analytics", "user": "rachel.chen", "message": "Found it! So accounts that had a service issue but received a proactive status alert via text or app notification showed a monthly churn rate of 1.6% in Q2 2026. That's pretty solid.", "create_at": 1736421600000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-success", "channel": "churn-analytics", "user": "david.patel", "message": "How does that compare to accounts without the proactive alerts?", "create_at": 1736421900000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-success", "channel": "churn-analytics", "user": "rachel.chen", "message": "Accounts that waited until they manually reported the issue had a churn rate of 1.95%. So the proactive alert group is about 18% lower I believe.", "create_at": 1736422200000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-success", "channel": "churn-analytics", "user": "marcus.thompson", "message": "That's a meaningful difference. Might be worth expanding the alert system to more service categories.", "create_at": 1736422500000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-success", "channel": "churn-analytics", "user": "jennifer.wu", "message": "Agreed! The system flagging issues early and notifying customers could be a game changer for retention across all departments.", "create_at": 1736422800000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-success", "channel": "churn-analytics", "user": "david.patel", "message": "I'll put together a summary deck for the exec meeting. Thanks Rachel for pulling those numbers quickly!", "create_at": 1736423100000}}

