{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-success", "channel": "support-analytics", "user": "marcus.wong", "message": "Hey team, just finished pulling the FY 2024 support communication analysis. Got some interesting findings to share.", "create_at": 1731254400000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-success", "channel": "support-analytics", "user": "jennifer.chen", "message": "Oh nice! What did you find? We've been waiting on the LTV comparison data.", "create_at": 1731254520000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-success", "channel": "support-analytics", "user": "marcus.wong", "message": "So here's the key finding: customers who received at least one personalized follow-up email referencing their specific product model or issue have an average Customer Lifetime Value that is **28% higher** than those who only received standard, generic templates.", "create_at": 1731254700000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-success", "channel": "support-analytics", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "28%?! That's huge. Are we talking about all product categories or specific ones?", "create_at": 1731254880000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-success", "channel": "support-analytics", "user": "marcus.wong", "message": "All categories across our grocery, electronics, and home goods departments. The personalization made a difference regardless of what they purchased.", "create_at": 1731255000000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-success", "channel": "support-analytics", "user": "david.ko", "message": "This makes a strong case for expanding our personalized communication program. @jennifer.chen weren't you working on email templates for the holiday season?", "create_at": 1731255180000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-success", "channel": "support-analytics", "user": "jennifer.chen", "message": "Yes! I was actually debating whether personalization was worth the extra effort. This data settles it. We should definitely include product-specific references in our follow-ups.", "create_at": 1731255360000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-success", "channel": "support-analytics", "user": "marcus.wong", "message": "Exactly. I'll put together a presentation for the leadership meeting next week. The ROI on personalized support is clear now.", "create_at": 1731255540000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-success", "channel": "support-analytics", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "Great work Marcus! Can you share the full report in the channel when ready?", "create_at": 1731255660000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-success", "channel": "support-analytics", "user": "marcus.wong", "message": "Will do. Should have the PDF uploaded by end of day tomorrow.", "create_at": 1731255780000}}

