{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "merchandising", "channel": "cross-sell-strategy", "user": "rachel.kim", "message": "Hey team, quick heads up - we're starting to plan the Q2-Q3 2025 promotional cycles for U.S. stores. Need to review our bakery cross-sell placement data before the meeting Thursday.", "create_at": 1712505600000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "merchandising", "channel": "cross-sell-strategy", "user": "derek.nguyen", "message": "Perfect timing! I just pulled the numbers from Q3-Q4 2023 analysis. Want me to share the summary?", "create_at": 1712506200000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "merchandising", "channel": "cross-sell-strategy", "user": "rachel.kim", "message": "Yes please! Especially interested in how bakery performs near different product categories.", "create_at": 1712506500000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "merchandising", "channel": "cross-sell-strategy", "user": "derek.nguyen", "message": "So here's what we found across all U.S. stores:\n\n| Bakery Placement | Cross-Sell Uplift |\n|------------------|-------------------|\n| Near Coffee | ~9% |\n| Near Snacks | ~9% |\n| Near Dairy | ~5% |\n\nBasically bakery items displayed near coffee or snack products generated an estimated 9% cross-sell uplift, compared to approximately 5% when placed beside dairy items.", "create_at": 1712507100000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "merchandising", "channel": "cross-sell-strategy", "user": "marcus.bell", "message": "That's a pretty significant gap between coffee/snacks and dairy. Almost double the uplift!", "create_at": 1712507400000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "merchandising", "channel": "cross-sell-strategy", "user": "jennifer.tran", "message": "Makes sense tbh. People grabbing morning coffee are way more likely to impulse buy a croissant than someone getting milk.", "create_at": 1712507700000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "merchandising", "channel": "cross-sell-strategy", "user": "rachel.kim", "message": "Good insight @jennifer.tran. Should we consider reallocating some of the dairy-adjacent bakery displays for Q2-Q3 2025?", "create_at": 1712508000000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "merchandising", "channel": "cross-sell-strategy", "user": "derek.nguyen", "message": "I'd recommend it. Even a 4% improvement on high-volume stores adds up fast. Let me prep a proposal for Thursday's meeting.", "create_at": 1712508300000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "merchandising", "channel": "cross-sell-strategy", "user": "marcus.bell", "message": "Can you also break it down by region? Curious if West Coast stores perform differently.", "create_at": 1712508600000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "merchandising", "channel": "cross-sell-strategy", "user": "derek.nguyen", "message": "Will do! I'll have regional splits ready by Wednesday EOD.", "create_at": 1712508900000}}

