{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "operations", "channel": "clinical-analytics", "user": "raj.patel", "message": "Hi team, just finished compiling the Q3 2025 internal analysis on clinician time allocation. Some interesting findings to share.", "create_at": 1694174400000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "operations", "channel": "clinical-analytics", "user": "emily.chen", "message": "Great timing @raj.patel! We've been waiting for this breakdown. What did you find?", "create_at": 1694174520000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "operations", "channel": "clinical-analytics", "user": "raj.patel", "message": "The data shows that **35% of clinician worktime per visit is spent on direct patient interaction and diagnosis** during virtual consultations. The rest goes to documentation, system navigation, and administrative tasks.", "create_at": 1694174700000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "operations", "channel": "clinical-analytics", "user": "dr.karen.mitchell", "message": "Only 35%? That's concerning. As a clinician, I'd expect at least half our time should be face-to-face with patients.", "create_at": 1694174880000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "operations", "channel": "clinical-analytics", "user": "marcus.johnson", "message": "I agree with Dr. Mitchell. That 35% figure for patient interaction and diagnosis seems low. What's eating up the remaining time?", "create_at": 1694175060000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "operations", "channel": "clinical-analytics", "user": "raj.patel", "message": "Breakdown is roughly:\n- 35% direct patient interaction/diagnosis\n- 28% clinical documentation\n- 22% EHR navigation and data entry\n- 15% administrative coordination", "create_at": 1694175240000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "operations", "channel": "clinical-analytics", "user": "emily.chen", "message": "This aligns with what clinicians have been telling us informally. We should prioritize workflow automation to boost that 35% patient interaction time.", "create_at": 1694175420000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "operations", "channel": "clinical-analytics", "user": "dr.karen.mitchell", "message": "Absolutely. If we could reduce documentation burden, we could potentially see 50%+ dedicated to actual patient care. I'll bring this to leadership next week.", "create_at": 1694175600000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "operations", "channel": "clinical-analytics", "user": "raj.patel", "message": "I'll prepare a detailed presentation with recommendations. Thanks everyone for the input!", "create_at": 1694175780000}}

