{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "clinical-ops", "channel": "workflow-optimization", "user": "marcus.okonkwo", "message": "Sure:\n1. One for scheduling\n2. One for patient interaction (our telehealth portal)\n3. One for electronic health records\n4. One for lab results\n5. One for billing\n\nEach requires separate logins and doesn't integrate well with the others.", "create_at": 1720959600000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "clinical-ops", "channel": "workflow-optimization", "user": "david.nguyen", "message": "That explains why Dr. Patel mentioned spending 20 minutes just logging into systems before her first patient call. This is impacting our virtual care delivery.", "create_at": 1720960200000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "clinical-ops", "channel": "workflow-optimization", "user": "jennifer.wu", "message": "We really need to consider consolidation. Having clinicians juggle five platforms for scheduling, patient interaction, EHR, lab results, and billing is unsustainable.", "create_at": 1720960500000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "clinical-ops", "channel": "workflow-optimization", "user": "sarah.chen", "message": "Agreed. I'll draft a proposal for leadership. Should we look at unified healthcare platforms that could reduce this to two or three systems?", "create_at": 1720960800000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "clinical-ops", "channel": "workflow-optimization", "user": "marcus.okonkwo", "message": "Great idea, Sarah. Let's schedule a working session for next week. This should be a priority for improving clinician satisfaction.", "create_at": 1720961100000}}

