{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "clinical-ops", "channel": "workflow-efficiency", "user": "james.wilson", "message": "Five platforms! That's a lot of context switching. No wonder the clinicians are reporting fatigue.", "create_at": 1701181200000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "clinical-ops", "channel": "workflow-efficiency", "user": "marcus.thompson", "message": "Exactly. Each platform has its own login, interface, and workflow. We should explore integration options for 2024.", "create_at": 1701181500000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "clinical-ops", "channel": "workflow-efficiency", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "I'll schedule a meeting with the IT leadership team next week. Having clinicians juggle five systems daily isn't sustainable for our growing patient base.", "create_at": 1701181800000}}
