{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "clinical-innovation", "channel": "lab-annotation-pilot", "user": "marcus.williams", "message": "Hey team! Just finished compiling the Q3 pilot results for the automated lab result annotation system. Ready to share findings whenever you're available.", "create_at": 1695206400000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "clinical-innovation", "channel": "lab-annotation-pilot", "user": "dr.rachel.chen", "message": "Perfect timing Marcus. The leadership team is asking for an update. What are we seeing?", "create_at": 1695207000000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "clinical-innovation", "channel": "lab-annotation-pilot", "user": "marcus.williams", "message": "The results are promising! The system is designed to reduce clinician review time by automatically flagging abnormal values and generating preliminary notes. Early testing shows a **15% reduction in documentation errors**.", "create_at": 1695207300000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "clinical-innovation", "channel": "lab-annotation-pilot", "user": "sarah.patel", "message": "I can confirm those numbers. We analyzed 2,400 lab results during the pilot period. The workflow integration has been surprisingly smooth - clinicians are adapting quickly.", "create_at": 1695207600000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "clinical-innovation", "channel": "lab-annotation-pilot", "user": "james.nguyen", "message": "From a technical standpoint, the integration with our existing EHR was seamless. No major system conflicts reported.", "create_at": 1695207900000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "clinical-innovation", "channel": "lab-annotation-pilot", "user": "dr.rachel.chen", "message": "This is excellent news. The 15% error reduction alone justifies continued investment. How are the clinicians feeling about the preliminary notes feature?", "create_at": 1695208200000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "clinical-innovation", "channel": "lab-annotation-pilot", "user": "marcus.williams", "message": "Mixed but mostly positive. Dr. Thompson mentioned it saves her roughly 8 minutes per patient session. Some docs want more customization options for the flagging thresholds.", "create_at": 1695208500000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "clinical-innovation", "channel": "lab-annotation-pilot", "user": "sarah.patel", "message": "I'd recommend we extend the pilot through Q4 to gather more data before full rollout. The streamlined workflow integration is there, but we need larger sample sizes.", "create_at": 1695208800000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "clinical-innovation", "channel": "lab-annotation-pilot", "user": "dr.rachel.chen", "message": "Agreed. Let's schedule a formal presentation for the executive team next week. Great work everyone - this pilot is shaping up nicely! \ud83c\udf89", "create_at": 1695209100000}}

