{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-insights", "channel": "loyalty-analytics", "user": "derek.chan", "message": "Hey team, just finished pulling the Q1 2025 projections for loyalty member spending. Leadership wants a breakdown by generation and channel for the quarterly review.", "create_at": 1687350000000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-insights", "channel": "loyalty-analytics", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "Nice! What are you seeing for the generational splits? We've been tracking some interesting patterns with younger shoppers.", "create_at": 1687350300000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-insights", "channel": "loyalty-analytics", "user": "derek.chan", "message": "So for Gen Z/Millennials, the average quarterly spend per loyalty member is $210 online and $340 in-store. Gen X/Boomers are spending $145 online but $450 in-store.", "create_at": 1687350600000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-insights", "channel": "loyalty-analytics", "user": "marcus.wong", "message": "Wow the in-store gap is significant! Older generations are definitely our bread and butter for physical locations.", "create_at": 1687350900000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-insights", "channel": "loyalty-analytics", "user": "jennifer.liu", "message": "Makes sense though - younger members are way more comfortable with our app and online ordering. Interesting that Gen Z/Millennials still spend more online than Gen X/Boomers.", "create_at": 1687351200000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-insights", "channel": "loyalty-analytics", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "Should we be investing more in digital marketing for the younger segments then? That $210 online could grow with the right push.", "create_at": 1687351500000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-insights", "channel": "loyalty-analytics", "user": "derek.chan", "message": "Definitely worth discussing. I'll put together a summary table for the exec presentation. The channel segmentation really tells the story here.", "create_at": 1687351800000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "customer-insights", "channel": "loyalty-analytics", "user": "marcus.wong", "message": "Don't forget to highlight that Gen X/Boomers $450 in-store figure - that's our highest segment. Store experience matters to them.", "create_at": 1687352100000}}

