{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "platform-engineering", "channel": "ai-integration", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "Hey team, had our planning session with leadership this morning. Wanted to share the roadmap for the AI anomaly detection integration.", "create_at": 1707566400000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "platform-engineering", "channel": "ai-integration", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "Great timing! We've been waiting on this. How are we structuring the rollout?", "create_at": 1707566520000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "platform-engineering", "channel": "ai-integration", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "The integration should be executed in three phases - assessment, implementation, and validation. We need to be methodical given the healthcare compliance requirements.", "create_at": 1707566700000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "platform-engineering", "channel": "ai-integration", "user": "jordan.williams", "message": "Makes sense. What's the scope for each phase? I'm guessing assessment covers our current infrastructure readiness?", "create_at": 1707566880000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "platform-engineering", "channel": "ai-integration", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "Exactly. Phase 1 assessment will audit our data pipelines and HIPAA compliance gaps. Phase 2 implementation is the actual model deployment. Phase 3 validation involves clinical testing with our partner clinics.", "create_at": 1707567000000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "platform-engineering", "channel": "ai-integration", "user": "elena.rodriguez", "message": "I'm excited about this! Having three phases gives us proper checkpoints. The validation phase is crucial - we can't deploy anomaly detection for patient vitals without rigorous testing.", "create_at": 1707567180000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "platform-engineering", "channel": "ai-integration", "user": "priya.sharma", "message": "Agreed. How many phases does management expect this to take timeline-wise? Are we looking at Q2 completion?", "create_at": 1707567300000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "platform-engineering", "channel": "ai-integration", "user": "marcus.chen", "message": "Target is end of Q2. Each phase roughly 6-8 weeks. I'll share the detailed Gantt chart tomorrow. @elena.rodriguez can you lead the assessment phase kickoff?", "create_at": 1707567480000}}
{"type": "post", "post": {"team": "platform-engineering", "channel": "ai-integration", "user": "elena.rodriguez", "message": "Absolutely! I'll draft the assessment checklist by EOD Wednesday. This three-phase approach will keep us on track and compliant. \ud83d\ude80", "create_at": 1707567600000}}

