{"type": "email", "id": "email_001", "subject": "2026 EV Model Design Strategy - Initial Thoughts", "from": "david.jones@elexionautomotive.com", "from_name": "David Jones", "to": ["ethan.smith@elexionautomotive.com"], "cc": ["emma.white@elexionautomotive.com", "sarah.martin@elexionautomotive.com"], "date": "2025-01-01 09:30:00", "body": "Dear Ethan,

As we're starting to plan our control interface design strategy for the 2026 EV models, we're considering prioritizing physical buttons and switches to reduce the higher control/display problem rate we've been experiencing.

