Best,
David", "folder": "inbox", "read": true, "attachments": []}
{"type": "email", "id": "email_002", "subject": "Re: 2026 EV Model Design Strategy - Initial Thoughts", "from": "ethan.smith@elexionautomotive.com", "from_name": "Ethan Smith", "to": ["david.jones@elexionautomotive.com"], "cc": ["emma.white@elexionautomotive.com", "sarah.martin@elexionautomotive.com"], "date": "2025-01-02 11:15:00", "body": "Dear David,

I agree with the direction of prioritizing physical buttons and switches for our 2026 EV models. From the Quality Assurance perspective, we've noticed that touch-based controls are more susceptible to temperature extremes.

